1
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:35,559
My Bey, why are they
waiting? Where are they?

2
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:38,159
They won't attack.

3
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:40,359
What's their intention, Osman Bey?

4
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,319
They want to slow us down.

5
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:44,239
Slow us down.

6
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:50,719
There are horses deep in the forest.

7
00:02:50,720 --> 00:02:52,919
They are shooting from there.

8
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:56,119
It's obvious from the speed of the arrows.

9
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:00,279
They are not crowded.

10
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:03,479
They are trying to make
themselves look crowded.

11
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:05,319
Who are they my Bey?

12
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:10,319
Orhan is in danger.

13
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:12,359
Orhan is in danger.

14
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,879
We need to go quickly!

15
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:18,399
Come on

16
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,479
Come on alps!

17
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,239
What should we do my Bey?

18
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,439
We won't stop.

19
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:41,039
It looks like Osman
realized what's going on.

20
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:46,519
Osman will not make
it in time for his son.

21
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:50,159
Come on.

22
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:54,799
Stall them as long as you can.

23
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,439
As you command my Bey.

24
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:16,199
Come on!

25
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,319
Orhan, go.

26
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:23,719
Go, Orhan, save yourself.

27
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:28,199
No, if I do that...

28
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:31,079
..I will die!

29
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,159
Enough!

30
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:35,479
First she will die..

31
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,479
...then you will die!

32
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:55,679
Holofira! You are okay right?

33
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,959
I am okay.

34
00:04:58,440 --> 00:05:00,999
But you are wounded.

35
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,599
I am okay.

36
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:04,559
You are..

37
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:06,959
...my remedy.

38
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,839
This way!

39
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:21,959
This forest will be your grave!

40
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:24,439
Damn dastard.

41
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:27,079
He will get his turn, but not now.

42
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:29,799
Come on Holofira.

43
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:44,119
Where is Orhan?

44
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:46,159
We turned their wedding
into a nightmare, my Bey.

45
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:48,399
My shahzade kidnapped Holofira Hatun.

46
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:56,159
Lucas must have
surrounded the whole forest.

47
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:58,079
They can't get out.

48
00:05:58,080 --> 00:05:58,879
Where are they?

49
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:00,639
They went North, my Bey.

50
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:04,279
You left them alone?

51
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:06,119
Shahzade Orhan was wounded.

52
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:08,199
We lured the soldiers to open their path.

53
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:09,279
What?

54
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:11,159
We had to, my Bey.

55
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:14,639
What are we going to do now, father?

56
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:16,039
He is wounded, huh?

57
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,359
It's hard for them to escape.

58
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:25,159
We will ride North!

59
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:35,199
Come.

60
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:48,319
This way, come on.

61
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:53,759
Where did they go?

62
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:56,959
This way!

63
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,199
Come on!

64
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:17,639
Orhan.

65
00:07:20,320 --> 00:07:21,839
They went over here.

66
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:23,839
Bring the horses now!

67
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:39,639
Orhan.

68
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:46,799
Are you okay?

69
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:47,879
I'm okay.

70
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,959
I'm okay Holofira.

71
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:52,279
Your wound is too deep.

72
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,759
How will we leave here?

73
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:58,519
We will.

74
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:03,639
We will leave, Lord's daughter.
We won't surrender.

75
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:05,919
We'll go to our home.

76
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:08,839
We'll go back to our tents, if Allah permits.

77
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:10,759
I know.

78
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:24,039
In the name of Allah.

79
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:13,919
I asked you a question, Lord's daughter.

80
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:15,919
Do you remember?

81
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:19,319
I want an answer.

82
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:26,479
Will you be my partner,

83
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:29,999
...join me in my dreams...

84
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:34,719
..and be my confidant?

85
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:51,959
Orhan.

86
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,959
Orhan. They're coming!

87
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:55,959
Go over there.

88
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:58,079
Watch my signal.

89
00:10:13,560 --> 00:10:14,599
Now!

90
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:39,559
Orhan!

91
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:42,399
I'll crush you..

92
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:45,719
...under my horse, without using a sword.

93
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:48,599
I'll cut off your head..

94
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:53,519
...and bring peace to
this world. Count on it!

95
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,039
Come here.

96
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:19,679
Osman and his men are coming.

97
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:23,039
This won't end here.

98
00:11:24,040 --> 00:11:25,799
We'll meet again.

99
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:28,399
Whenever you want Arcadeus.

100
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:43,639
What?

101
00:11:47,520 --> 00:11:48,559
Let's get married.

102
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,039
We'll finally unite.

103
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:04,439
We will.

104
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,439
So, now you're telling me...

105
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,799
...you accept it?

106
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:13,159
And you accept my proposal is that so?

107
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:18,159
Allah.

108
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,919
Orhan!

109
00:12:22,640 --> 00:12:24,279
My bey. Brother.

110
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:27,679
Thank Allah you're okay.

111
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:31,199
Son you're okay right?

112
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:34,559
Just a small wound, my bey.

113
00:12:34,560 --> 00:12:36,879
But that's like an accessory for an alp.

114
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:41,039
Girl, are you okay?

115
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:42,239
I'm okay, thank you.

116
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,359
Good.

117
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:45,159
My bey.

118
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:48,839
I did this without asking your permission.

119
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:50,079
Please forgive me.

120
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:51,639
But...

121
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:52,879
Look here.

122
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:54,399
What are you saying?

123
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:56,439
Of course not.

124
00:12:58,040 --> 00:13:00,239
If I was in your place...

125
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:02,479
..I would do the same.

126
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:06,079
Holofira can be considered my daughter.

127
00:13:08,680 --> 00:13:10,159
My bey.

128
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:12,839
If it's okay with you too...

129
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:14,759
...I want her..

130
00:13:14,760 --> 00:13:17,959
...to be both your daughter...

131
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:20,639
...and your daughter in law.

132
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:26,799
Osman Bey.

133
00:13:26,800 --> 00:13:29,879
You always viewed me as your daughter.

134
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:33,079
And I always viewed you as my father too.

135
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:37,559
I wish to be your
daughter in law too, now.

136
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:48,279
..you say so..

137
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:55,279
It's okay with me too.

138
00:13:57,880 --> 00:14:00,319
We should not stand
against those in love...

139
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:01,879
...but by their side.

140
00:14:01,880 --> 00:14:03,439
Thank you my bey.

141
00:14:04,880 --> 00:14:06,559
Then..

142
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:11,919
...let's go back to our
tribe and hold a big feast.

143
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:21,719
May your happiness
be everlasting, brother.

144
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:23,239
Thank you brother.

145
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:25,319
By the way, my bey...

146
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:30,639
...we stopped Karesi Bey from having fun.

147
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:32,919
He was there too.

148
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:38,599
Are you telling me that he was there too?

149
00:14:50,920 --> 00:14:52,839
Orhan.

150
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:56,079
How dare you...

151
00:15:04,040 --> 00:15:06,719
...kidnap a Byzantine aristocrat
from a Byzantine wedding?

152
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:10,639
How dare you?

153
00:15:14,760 --> 00:15:18,719
I'm going to destroy you with your father.

154
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:21,159
Order us and we'll turn
their lands into ruins.

155
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:25,119
No Hristo, our pawns will do that for us.

156
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:27,159
What is your plan, commander?

157
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:31,199
We're going to make the Byzantine
people under Osman's rule riot.

158
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:34,999
But for that we need a spark.

159
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:39,479
Commander Lucas, thank God.

160
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:41,279
Father.

161
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:44,919
Father.

162
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:48,719
I'm so embarrassed.

163
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:53,919
After what Orhan made you go
through you must be so scared.

164
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:58,039
Such a low, dishonorable attack.

165
00:15:58,400 --> 00:16:01,359
Where were you? Did anyone see you?

166
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:04,799
After the attack I hid in
my own house, commander.

167
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:06,919
No one saw me.

168
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:12,319
I would've loved to confess
in front of you one last time.

169
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:14,919
But...

170
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:16,279
...unfortunately...

171
00:16:16,280 --> 00:16:18,399
...your life is not long enough for that.

172
00:16:21,560 --> 00:16:24,399
That's the spark we were looking for, Hristo.

173
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:34,079
Take him away.

174
00:16:40,280 --> 00:16:42,279
Send word to Arcadeus.

175
00:16:42,920 --> 00:16:46,239
They'll have a small
similarity with the Father.

176
00:16:52,920 --> 00:16:55,679
-Welcome.
-Welcome Osman Bey.

177
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:58,639
-Welcome back my bey.
-Welcome back.

178
00:16:58,640 --> 00:17:01,479
-Thank you.
-Welcome back.

179
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:04,319
Thank you.

180
00:17:04,319 --> 00:17:06,638
-Welcome.
-Welcome back.

181
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:15,959
Welcome, Osman Bey!

182
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:18,919
Welcome, my Bey!

183
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:20,479
Welcome all!

184
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:24,519
Thank Allah. They've
returned safe and sound.

185
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:35,679
Welcome, my Bey!

186
00:17:35,800 --> 00:17:37,679
Welcome!

187
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:44,439
Welcome, my Bey!

188
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:48,759
-Father.
-Daughter.

189
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:51,559
Mother.

190
00:17:51,840 --> 00:17:55,759
I've kept my promise and
brought your bride here.

191
00:17:56,800 --> 00:18:01,159
I knew it. My Orhan
always keeps his promises.

192
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:04,799
Holofira.

193
00:18:12,600 --> 00:18:14,119
Brother.

194
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,279
My sister.

195
00:18:19,080 --> 00:18:21,559
-Welcome. Thank Allah.
-Mother.

196
00:18:21,680 --> 00:18:24,919
May you always be happy, brother.

197
00:18:25,840 --> 00:18:28,319
If Allah permits.

198
00:18:32,480 --> 00:18:34,479
Welcome home, daughter.

199
00:18:34,560 --> 00:18:36,319
Thank you.

200
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:57,839
Start preparations.

201
00:18:57,960 --> 00:19:01,439
Let's have a great wedding.

202
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:07,199
Send words to the Beys.

203
00:19:07,280 --> 00:19:11,559
But above all to Karasi Bey.

204
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:19,519
Because he likes celebrations
that much, let him see our wedding.

205
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:22,799
Let him come and see
how great our wedding is!

206
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:24,839
As you command, my Bey.

207
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:26,799
Beys.

208
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:32,479
I'll be waiting for you in my presence.

209
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:48,319
They won't even wait forty days after
our child's death, huh Alaaddin Bey?

210
00:20:00,160 --> 00:20:02,679
Hey everyone!

211
00:20:02,920 --> 00:20:05,599
The warriors of Holy Rome.

212
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:08,679
The forgiver of our sins..

213
00:20:08,760 --> 00:20:11,599
..the hand of God on earth..

214
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:13,799
...our priest, has been slain!

215
00:20:13,840 --> 00:20:15,799
-How can this be?
-How?

216
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:18,759
-How could they do this?
-Curse them!

217
00:20:18,960 --> 00:20:22,359
The one, who killed our holy priest...

218
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:25,599
...the one, who insulted our holiness...

219
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:27,079
...is Orhan Bey!

220
00:20:29,160 --> 00:20:33,799
Of course, he got the order
from his father, Osman Bey!

221
00:20:35,240 --> 00:20:39,799
They killed the priest in order to
capture my bride at my wedding!

222
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:43,999
This is not only a loss.

223
00:20:44,520 --> 00:20:46,319
This is an awakening!

224
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:51,479
Our enemies want to shake
our faith and destroy us...

225
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:56,079
...by targeting the servants of God!

226
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:56,999
Wake up!

227
00:20:57,040 --> 00:20:59,239
-Tyrants!
-Tyrants!

228
00:20:59,320 --> 00:21:02,279
Don't you think the time has come
for us to take revenge on the Turks?

229
00:21:02,320 --> 00:21:03,399
It has!

230
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:05,959
-For Holy Rome!
-For Holy Rome!

231
00:21:06,040 --> 00:21:08,239
-For our religion!
-For our religion!

232
00:21:08,280 --> 00:21:11,559
-For revenge!
-For revenge!

233
00:21:11,760 --> 00:21:14,119
Lukas and Karasi Bey.

234
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:22,359
They thought they could beat us when
they combined the sides of the water.

235
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:26,559
Blindness, Osman Bey.
They are in blindness.

236
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:29,999
But today, the fire
going through the skies...

237
00:21:30,160 --> 00:21:34,159
...must have destroyed their
endurance and courage, for sure!

238
00:21:34,280 --> 00:21:35,519
No.

239
00:21:36,840 --> 00:21:40,729
The real headlessness is
when you underestimate your enemy...

240
00:21:40,741 --> 00:21:44,799
...and lower your guard
as you think your enemy is incapable.

241
00:21:45,840 --> 00:21:50,479
Do you think they will be
allies from now on, Osman Bey?

242
00:21:50,600 --> 00:21:55,559
If I know Karasi Bey, he has no
business with the heathens but trading.

243
00:21:55,920 --> 00:22:00,879
They've already become allies,
Begum Hatun, don't you see it?

244
00:22:01,280 --> 00:22:04,799
The grudge they had against
us made them come together.

245
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:09,639
We heard that Karasi Bey
even went to their celebration.

246
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:17,199
From now on, their alliance is one
the most dangerous things we could face.

247
00:22:17,480 --> 00:22:22,239
We will be cautious. We
will know of their every step.

248
00:22:25,320 --> 00:22:26,799
You may leave.

249
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:35,249
Orhan.

250
00:22:35,249 --> 00:22:36,279
Yes my Bey.

251
00:22:36,640 --> 00:22:38,999
Prepare your best alp.

252
00:22:39,160 --> 00:22:41,479
He will sneak into the infidels.

253
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:43,719
He will be Lucas' shadow.

254
00:22:44,400 --> 00:22:46,959
We will know of every step Lucas takes.

255
00:22:47,320 --> 00:22:48,839
As you command my Bey.

256
00:22:59,200 --> 00:23:01,559
How could you forget so quickly?

257
00:23:05,240 --> 00:23:07,679
How can you hold a wedding feast...

258
00:23:08,040 --> 00:23:10,239
...as if nothing happened?

259
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:16,959
How can you accept Holofira?

260
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:21,199
But I won't forget.

261
00:23:23,080 --> 00:23:24,839
I'll not forget, my baby.

262
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:26,719
Gonca.

263
00:23:28,240 --> 00:23:30,039
I brought you sherbet.

264
00:23:31,040 --> 00:23:32,839
You aren't eating anything.

265
00:23:35,440 --> 00:23:37,599
At least drink this.

266
00:23:37,600 --> 00:23:39,039
Ulgen.

267
00:23:39,720 --> 00:23:42,799
Are you mocking me!?

268
00:23:42,960 --> 00:23:46,279
Did you bring me the sherbet
you prepared for the feast?

269
00:23:46,280 --> 00:23:48,239
I just wanted you to...

270
00:23:49,040 --> 00:23:50,559
Gonca, are you okay?

271
00:23:58,720 --> 00:23:59,959
Gonca.

272
00:24:02,040 --> 00:24:03,039
Gonca.

273
00:24:03,040 --> 00:24:06,679
Alaeddin, I am not okay!

274
00:24:07,400 --> 00:24:11,999
As long as Holofira is
here, I won't be okay!

275
00:24:12,320 --> 00:24:13,479
Gonca.

276
00:24:14,040 --> 00:24:15,319
You know the best...

277
00:24:15,960 --> 00:24:20,199
...about Holofira and my brother's
love, and the tests they went through.

278
00:24:21,040 --> 00:24:24,159
After I lost my child..

279
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:27,999
...I forgot all I knew, Alaeddin!

280
00:24:29,160 --> 00:24:31,959
Why don't you understand?

281
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:38,919
I feel hurt whenever I see her!

282
00:24:39,760 --> 00:24:41,759
What should I do?

283
00:24:42,920 --> 00:24:44,999
I know what we should do.

284
00:24:45,840 --> 00:24:47,639
We should leave, Alaeddin.

285
00:24:50,520 --> 00:24:52,359
If you love me..

286
00:24:52,840 --> 00:24:56,439
...if you want my tears to stop...

287
00:24:56,760 --> 00:24:58,039
...we should leave.

288
00:25:01,840 --> 00:25:03,799
Just you and me.

289
00:25:10,840 --> 00:25:14,119
Thank Allah we..

290
00:25:14,360 --> 00:25:15,879
...brought Holofira back safe and sound.

291
00:25:15,880 --> 00:25:17,199
Thank Allah my Bey.

292
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:18,359
Thank Allah.

293
00:25:22,640 --> 00:25:24,159
So, Bala.

294
00:25:24,680 --> 00:25:27,279
Where are Alaeddin and Gonca?

295
00:25:32,840 --> 00:25:34,839
Gonca is not feeling well.

296
00:25:34,840 --> 00:25:37,159
I didn't want Alaeddin to leave her alone.

297
00:25:38,000 --> 00:25:39,599
You thought well.

298
00:25:40,160 --> 00:25:43,639
We shouldn't leave her alone.

299
00:25:44,640 --> 00:25:46,759
She is going through a lot.

300
00:25:46,920 --> 00:25:50,479
But don't worry. From now on..

301
00:25:51,120 --> 00:25:53,879
..we will overcome all the troubles.

302
00:25:54,640 --> 00:25:56,039
If Allah permits.

303
00:26:02,360 --> 00:26:03,839
So, my Bey.

304
00:26:04,000 --> 00:26:06,239
We got the good news.

305
00:26:06,720 --> 00:26:08,799
We are going to hold our wedding feast.

306
00:26:12,800 --> 00:26:15,799
We are going to hold a
wedding feast my Bey.

307
00:26:16,760 --> 00:26:18,359
We are, yes.

308
00:26:21,680 --> 00:26:23,159
You know, before that...

309
00:26:32,280 --> 00:26:33,359
Now...

310
00:26:38,200 --> 00:26:40,959
...I need to give a speech.

311
00:26:41,920 --> 00:26:46,239
And I have been waiting for
you to speak what's on your mind.

312
00:26:47,800 --> 00:26:49,319
Then..

313
00:26:53,480 --> 00:26:57,559
...there is no need to keep this going.

314
00:26:58,520 --> 00:27:01,559
With the order of Allah and
the word of the prophet...

315
00:27:02,680 --> 00:27:05,439
...I ask Holofira's hand in
marriage for my son Orhan.

316
00:27:10,040 --> 00:27:11,799
You can't do it like that.

317
00:27:11,800 --> 00:27:12,839
How should I do it?

318
00:27:13,880 --> 00:27:16,919
We should think about it first.

319
00:27:20,760 --> 00:27:22,399
Let's think.

320
00:27:28,080 --> 00:27:30,319
...will your son take care of my girl?

321
00:27:30,320 --> 00:27:32,319
What?

322
00:27:37,600 --> 00:27:38,439
Mother.

323
00:27:39,000 --> 00:27:39,999
Don't.

324
00:27:40,320 --> 00:27:41,799
You know my brother.

325
00:27:41,840 --> 00:27:43,799
Wait up. Wait.

326
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:50,119
Bala. Don't.

327
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:52,239
Sweetheart. My dear wife.

328
00:27:52,800 --> 00:27:55,999
It's time to unite these lovers.
Let's not make them wait.

329
00:27:56,000 --> 00:27:57,159
No.

330
00:27:58,960 --> 00:28:00,599
I used to be on the groom's side.

331
00:28:01,160 --> 00:28:02,359
Now I side with her.

332
00:28:05,200 --> 00:28:06,999
I'll ask my girl first.

333
00:28:07,400 --> 00:28:08,799
Sweet girl!

334
00:28:09,320 --> 00:28:10,559
What do you think?

335
00:28:10,560 --> 00:28:12,559
Say it Holofira.

336
00:28:14,240 --> 00:28:16,759
Come on my girl. Speak.

337
00:28:21,160 --> 00:28:22,279
I don't know.

338
00:28:23,560 --> 00:28:25,599
Do as you wish mother Bala.

339
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:29,359
Don't do this my girl. Don't. Don't.

340
00:28:35,160 --> 00:28:36,199
This is bad.

341
00:28:36,200 --> 00:28:39,239
My Bey. We saved her from the Byzantines.

342
00:28:39,280 --> 00:28:41,239
But we can't save her from mother Bala.

343
00:28:41,400 --> 00:28:43,239
It's bad. She won't do it.

344
00:28:44,560 --> 00:28:45,599
Of course.

345
00:28:46,040 --> 00:28:48,239
Marrying a girl requires a lot of hard work!

346
00:28:48,239 --> 00:28:51,339
How many times did you ask
my father if we could marry, Osman Bey?

347
00:28:51,339 --> 00:28:52,759
Did you forget?

348
00:28:55,240 --> 00:28:56,519
Mother Bala..

349
00:28:57,040 --> 00:29:01,599
...knows I've been in love
with Holofira since I met her.

350
00:29:01,600 --> 00:29:02,439
Yes.

351
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:03,639
Right, mother?

352
00:29:05,320 --> 00:29:07,159
Yes. I know.

353
00:29:07,240 --> 00:29:08,519
You know.

354
00:29:12,240 --> 00:29:13,119
Yes.

355
00:29:14,560 --> 00:29:15,959
Then..

356
00:29:16,280 --> 00:29:17,359
...200 goats.

357
00:29:17,440 --> 00:29:17,759
What?

358
00:29:20,160 --> 00:29:22,039
1000 gold coins.

359
00:29:22,280 --> 00:29:23,199
1000?

360
00:29:29,800 --> 00:29:30,919
10...

361
00:29:31,120 --> 00:29:32,079
20 camels.

362
00:29:32,080 --> 00:29:34,079
20 camels?

363
00:29:34,520 --> 00:29:36,159
We have to, my Bey.

364
00:29:40,480 --> 00:29:41,559
It's 30 now.

365
00:29:41,560 --> 00:29:42,519
Bala.

366
00:29:45,600 --> 00:29:48,439
My Bey. If you wait longer it'll be more.

367
00:29:52,800 --> 00:29:53,719
I accept.

368
00:29:55,520 --> 00:29:57,079
Good.

369
00:29:59,360 --> 00:30:02,839
If they love each other...

370
00:30:02,840 --> 00:30:04,839
...and if they wish to unite...

371
00:30:05,840 --> 00:30:08,479
...we must build a home for them.

372
00:30:08,480 --> 00:30:10,119
That's it.

373
00:30:10,400 --> 00:30:12,039
Hold on. Hold on.

374
00:30:15,240 --> 00:30:16,719
I accept.

375
00:30:16,720 --> 00:30:17,719
That's it.

376
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:19,239
Good.

377
00:30:20,240 --> 00:30:21,639
Thank Allah.

378
00:30:25,840 --> 00:30:26,999
What is this?

379
00:30:28,120 --> 00:30:30,119
What is that sound?

380
00:30:30,960 --> 00:30:32,319
What are you doing here?

381
00:30:35,000 --> 00:30:38,159
Why are you here? Go back!

382
00:30:47,800 --> 00:30:49,919
Go back! Go away!

383
00:30:52,720 --> 00:30:54,319
Leave!

384
00:30:55,640 --> 00:30:57,519
Just you and two of your men.

385
00:30:58,000 --> 00:30:59,519
The rest will stay.

386
00:31:00,640 --> 00:31:01,919
Take their swords.

387
00:32:05,520 --> 00:32:06,679
Osman!

388
00:32:07,840 --> 00:32:09,599
You may win for now..

389
00:32:10,960 --> 00:32:12,879
...but it won't last long.

390
00:32:54,360 --> 00:32:58,799
The wounds we caused made
you come all this way, I see.

391
00:33:01,600 --> 00:33:03,599
Commander.

392
00:33:03,600 --> 00:33:06,679
I'd say that you heard
about our wedding feast...

393
00:33:06,680 --> 00:33:09,919
...which is in two days but...

394
00:33:10,320 --> 00:33:12,799
...it's not the right time.

395
00:33:15,080 --> 00:33:17,559
Besides we didn't invite you either.

396
00:33:23,520 --> 00:33:27,839
...came here to take
Holofira where she belongs.

397
00:33:33,160 --> 00:33:35,119
You come to my tribe.

398
00:33:35,560 --> 00:33:37,759
You stand in front of me...

399
00:33:38,280 --> 00:33:42,439
...and ask for my daughter in law huh?

400
00:33:42,920 --> 00:33:44,239
Is that so?

401
00:33:44,240 --> 00:33:46,519
You, Osman Bey...

402
00:33:47,360 --> 00:33:50,679
...ruined my bridge.

403
00:33:50,960 --> 00:33:55,159
Your son Orhan came
into my lands with his men...

404
00:33:55,280 --> 00:33:57,399
...and ruined the wedding.

405
00:33:57,400 --> 00:34:00,279
A Byzantine royalty...

406
00:34:02,760 --> 00:34:07,279
He kidnapped Arcedeus's bride-to-be.

407
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:15,518
I won't let this go.

408
00:34:17,560 --> 00:34:19,359
Is that so?

409
00:34:24,920 --> 00:34:26,438
What will you do?

410
00:34:26,440 --> 00:34:30,199
Either I'll take Holofira and leave...

411
00:34:33,000 --> 00:34:34,759
Or?

412
00:34:35,600 --> 00:34:38,679
Or it will cost you a lot.

413
00:34:47,320 --> 00:34:49,518
Look at me.

414
00:34:50,120 --> 00:34:54,759
That bridge which you
tried to build with Karesi...

415
00:34:55,440 --> 00:34:58,599
Do you remember the fire there?

416
00:35:01,560 --> 00:35:05,199
If you try to make me pay a price...

417
00:35:05,360 --> 00:35:09,719
...don't you dare forget those fires.

418
00:35:10,440 --> 00:35:11,959
Because..

419
00:35:11,960 --> 00:35:14,839
..with every move you make..

420
00:35:14,840 --> 00:35:17,239
...the only thing you'll see...

421
00:35:17,840 --> 00:35:20,239
..will be that fire.

422
00:35:24,560 --> 00:35:27,879
I'm already where I belong.

423
00:35:29,760 --> 00:35:31,679
Leave me alone.

424
00:35:32,120 --> 00:35:35,079
You're going to regret this Holofira.

425
00:35:44,920 --> 00:35:46,119
You too.

426
00:35:46,160 --> 00:35:48,319
Here is the field.

427
00:35:48,320 --> 00:35:50,679
Here is the man.

428
00:35:51,880 --> 00:35:54,239
Come on. Let us see you too.

429
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:35,999
She brought trouble...

430
00:36:36,000 --> 00:36:38,359
...alongside herself.

431
00:36:43,859 --> 00:36:45,769
Kayi Tents

432
00:36:46,720 --> 00:36:50,559
-Come on. Fill the cups.
-Come on.

433
00:36:52,160 --> 00:36:54,239
One for Saruca.

434
00:36:54,240 --> 00:36:57,639
-You can drink it come on.
-Write it down.

435
00:36:57,640 --> 00:37:01,119
-Come on. Drink it.
-One for me too.

436
00:37:01,120 --> 00:37:03,719
-Come on.
Write one down for Yusuf.

437
00:37:05,280 --> 00:37:07,159
Come on be quick.

438
00:37:10,280 --> 00:37:13,799
-Come on. Write it down.
-One for Saruca. Come on Yusuf.

439
00:37:13,800 --> 00:37:16,719
Come on brother Yusuf,
don't let him take the lead.

440
00:37:20,160 --> 00:37:21,999
Don't give up, brother!

441
00:37:25,040 --> 00:37:26,559
Again!

442
00:37:26,680 --> 00:37:29,079
Come on! Come on now!

443
00:37:29,320 --> 00:37:31,879
He won't be able to drink this!

444
00:37:31,960 --> 00:37:35,439
Come on, don't give up
now, brother! Don't give up!

445
00:37:35,760 --> 00:37:37,919
Don't give up, come on!

446
00:37:38,840 --> 00:37:42,439
Boran Bey, it's hitting me
hard, Boran Bey! I won't stop!

447
00:37:42,920 --> 00:37:45,599
Belly on the horse, strength with the man!

448
00:37:48,360 --> 00:37:51,959
Look he'll give up! Come on!

449
00:38:04,600 --> 00:38:07,759
Come on!

450
00:38:11,680 --> 00:38:15,799
The one burning fast, goes
out early, Boran brother.

451
00:38:27,960 --> 00:38:30,279
Brothers, bring some water.

452
00:38:33,200 --> 00:38:34,919
It's a draw.

453
00:38:35,600 --> 00:38:36,719
It will be repeated!

454
00:38:36,760 --> 00:38:40,719
Mother! Mother! Mother!

455
00:38:43,000 --> 00:38:44,679
You are being called.

456
00:38:51,000 --> 00:39:00,319
In Karacahisar, Yenisher and
Sogut, with the order of Lukas...

457
00:39:01,560 --> 00:39:06,430
...you've gotten into the
Greeks, who live in the

458
00:39:06,442 --> 00:39:10,999
fake heaven of Osman
and won their hearts.

459
00:39:12,040 --> 00:39:17,959
Now, it's time to bring
rebellion, grudge...

460
00:39:19,040 --> 00:39:21,639
...and hatred into those hearts!

461
00:39:21,760 --> 00:39:26,199
They'll riot for the
revenge of their priest!

462
00:39:26,960 --> 00:39:33,679
Karacahisar, Yenisehir and Sogut...

463
00:39:34,480 --> 00:39:37,719
...will be destroyed with
the rebellion of the Greeks!

464
00:39:38,120 --> 00:39:44,279
Now, go and start the war.

465
00:39:44,320 --> 00:39:46,719
As you command!

466
00:39:50,440 --> 00:39:57,399
This armed angry crowd
will be your end, Osman.

467
00:40:06,200 --> 00:40:11,079
Sergeant Aykut, they've been
gathering in this house since morning.

468
00:40:11,200 --> 00:40:13,599
Then, there is something wrong.

469
00:40:13,720 --> 00:40:17,159
No one will reveal himself. Send
words to the tribe immediately!

470
00:40:17,240 --> 00:40:18,919
As you command, my Bey.

471
00:40:21,040 --> 00:40:24,679
We've heard you are a
talented stableman, Irbay.

472
00:40:25,480 --> 00:40:30,479
Though our horses in good hands,
our intention is that they never reach that.

473
00:40:30,560 --> 00:40:34,067
As we all know, your
intellect and strength

474
00:40:34,079 --> 00:40:37,199
is much better than
a common stableman.

475
00:40:37,520 --> 00:40:39,359
-Thank you, my Bey.
-It's alright.

476
00:40:39,440 --> 00:40:44,639
And you should know that we
see you more than a stableman.

477
00:40:44,720 --> 00:40:46,719
I'm ready for any order.

478
00:40:46,760 --> 00:40:50,559
But in this road, you
could be a martyr or ghazi.

479
00:40:50,640 --> 00:40:55,599
There are many difficulties,
you should know that.

480
00:40:55,760 --> 00:41:01,959
I'm ready to die for Osman Bey
and you, my Shehzade and my state

481
00:41:02,080 --> 00:41:05,759
May you live long. Then, your duty is...

482
00:41:07,280 --> 00:41:10,239
...going to Lukas as a spy.

483
00:41:11,000 --> 00:41:14,404
We need to know what
he is eating, where he

484
00:41:14,416 --> 00:41:17,599
is going, in short,
everything about him.

485
00:41:17,960 --> 00:41:20,079
As you command, my Bey.

486
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:23,359
But...

487
00:41:24,800 --> 00:41:29,239
...my daughter, my dear, my Ayse.

488
00:41:30,120 --> 00:41:32,039
Protect her, my Bey.

489
00:41:33,040 --> 00:41:36,399
Don't worry. Now...

490
00:41:37,640 --> 00:41:40,319
Now, listen to me carefully, Ilbay.

491
00:41:44,800 --> 00:41:45,999
Yusuf.

492
00:41:47,400 --> 00:41:49,039
What's wrong?

493
00:41:51,160 --> 00:41:54,159
I beat Sarica in the pekmez war.

494
00:41:54,320 --> 00:41:57,639
When I got the last glass,
he was already on the ground.

495
00:41:57,760 --> 00:42:00,719
Praise be, praise be.

496
00:42:01,360 --> 00:42:06,919
Since when courage is
measured by pekmez jars?

497
00:42:07,200 --> 00:42:10,679
In the name of Allah.

498
00:42:11,040 --> 00:42:13,319
Yusuf, instead of doing
unnecessary things like this...

499
00:42:13,480 --> 00:42:15,839
...try to win Fatma Hatun's heart.

500
00:42:16,400 --> 00:42:17,679
Sister.

501
00:42:19,720 --> 00:42:22,599
You ask me to win Fatma Hatun's heart.

502
00:42:23,040 --> 00:42:25,759
And you also keep fighting Bala Hatun.

503
00:42:26,040 --> 00:42:27,479
Why is that?

504
00:42:27,680 --> 00:42:30,919
Since when do you question my decisions?

505
00:42:32,560 --> 00:42:34,559
I know what to do.

506
00:42:35,680 --> 00:42:38,879
How can I win her heart when
you make her mother angry at us?

507
00:42:39,800 --> 00:42:41,159
Tell me that.

508
00:42:42,960 --> 00:42:46,559
It's my duty to put
people in their places...

509
00:42:46,840 --> 00:42:49,439
...and it's your duty to win...

510
00:42:49,440 --> 00:42:51,519
...her heart.

511
00:42:51,800 --> 00:42:52,999
Use your head.

512
00:42:54,120 --> 00:42:55,119
Okay.

513
00:43:09,200 --> 00:43:10,679
Mother!

514
00:43:10,920 --> 00:43:12,599
I am dying mother!

515
00:43:13,040 --> 00:43:14,559
Mother!

516
00:43:14,560 --> 00:43:16,439
You can't die from eating pekmez.

517
00:43:20,480 --> 00:43:22,199
It hurts, mother!

518
00:43:22,320 --> 00:43:24,239
Let me get you some water.

519
00:43:30,760 --> 00:43:32,959
Mother!

520
00:43:32,960 --> 00:43:37,199
Drink this.

521
00:43:37,200 --> 00:43:38,769
Don't give me more pekmez, mother!

522
00:43:38,769 --> 00:43:40,839
It's water! Drink it!

523
00:43:42,040 --> 00:43:43,079
Mother!

524
00:44:10,440 --> 00:44:12,119
Get up! Get up!

525
00:44:12,120 --> 00:44:14,839
Get up! Stand straight.

526
00:44:15,160 --> 00:44:18,639
You need to stand
straight in front of a Hatun.

527
00:44:19,480 --> 00:44:22,199
Hey. Stop it.

528
00:44:23,680 --> 00:44:24,999
Stop it. Stand up.

529
00:44:26,000 --> 00:44:28,919
Stand tall and strong.

530
00:44:31,120 --> 00:44:32,159
Then..

531
00:44:34,160 --> 00:44:39,039
...take a glance and touch your mustache.

532
00:44:40,440 --> 00:44:41,599
Sarica.

533
00:44:42,120 --> 00:44:44,079
Do it like your father.

534
00:44:44,680 --> 00:44:46,639
I don't have a mustache mother.

535
00:44:49,240 --> 00:44:51,439
Have a clean voice.

536
00:44:51,880 --> 00:44:54,559
Peace be with you Hatun.

537
00:44:55,320 --> 00:44:57,599
Just tell her, "Say your name."

538
00:44:57,920 --> 00:44:58,839
Say it.

539
00:44:58,960 --> 00:45:00,559
I know her name mother. It's Fatma.

540
00:45:01,800 --> 00:45:03,199
Fatma, mother.

541
00:45:05,240 --> 00:45:07,239
Then...

542
00:45:07,280 --> 00:45:11,079
...read her a poem by the master Yunus.

543
00:45:14,000 --> 00:45:16,599
Hear my words, oh my friends.

544
00:45:17,840 --> 00:45:20,039
Love is a valuable thing.

545
00:45:20,760 --> 00:45:22,599
You can't name a price for it.

546
00:45:23,400 --> 00:45:25,359
Love is greater thing.

547
00:45:25,360 --> 00:45:26,559
Hey.

548
00:45:27,640 --> 00:45:29,319
Hold on Bayhan Bey.

549
00:45:30,960 --> 00:45:33,959
You never told me a poem.

550
00:45:34,840 --> 00:45:36,159
Never stroke your mustache.

551
00:45:39,480 --> 00:45:40,999
Hatun...WelL

552
00:45:41,000 --> 00:45:45,279
Did you read poems to other
Hatuns and touch your mustache?

553
00:45:48,000 --> 00:45:52,839
I want to die! I want to die! Allah!

554
00:45:53,280 --> 00:45:54,559
Allah!

555
00:45:54,760 --> 00:45:59,599
Hatun! My sweetheart.
Look at your tiny body.

556
00:46:00,040 --> 00:46:01,079
Tiny body?

557
00:46:04,720 --> 00:46:09,239
Allah! I'm too old to be cheated on.

558
00:46:10,600 --> 00:46:12,239
Father.

559
00:46:12,520 --> 00:46:15,919
You have to stand up straight
in front of women, father.

560
00:46:16,080 --> 00:46:17,119
Stand tall, father.

561
00:46:17,120 --> 00:46:18,279
Allah..

562
00:46:18,280 --> 00:46:20,399
Like this father.

563
00:46:20,640 --> 00:46:25,399
Allah...Bayhan what are you doing?

564
00:46:26,280 --> 00:46:29,239
Allah, look at what has happened to me.

565
00:46:42,000 --> 00:46:44,759
Osman Bey is coming, be ready.

566
00:47:00,240 --> 00:47:01,599
Come on.

567
00:47:24,440 --> 00:47:26,239
Where did they come from my bey?

568
00:47:26,240 --> 00:47:27,519
What are they doing here?

569
00:47:27,520 --> 00:47:29,679
Lucas must've found out about us.

570
00:47:51,440 --> 00:47:52,959
They're out of arrows, my bey.

571
00:47:52,960 --> 00:47:54,679
Come on alps.

572
00:47:56,280 --> 00:47:57,759
Alps.

573
00:47:57,760 --> 00:48:00,159
Hit the chests of the infidels.

574
00:48:34,560 --> 00:48:37,039
Allah is the greatest!

575
00:49:10,400 --> 00:49:12,679
Allah is the greatest!

576
00:49:36,800 --> 00:49:38,519
That dog called Lucas!

577
00:49:38,760 --> 00:49:41,079
He is attacking us like a rabid dog!

578
00:49:41,720 --> 00:49:44,239
That demon!

579
00:49:44,800 --> 00:49:47,479
He will keep attacking us.

580
00:49:47,760 --> 00:49:49,279
But we...

581
00:49:50,200 --> 00:49:53,439
...we will always be cautious.

582
00:49:53,920 --> 00:49:56,359
That's why, we will...

583
00:49:56,560 --> 00:50:00,879
...increase security in the
cities, tribes and borders.

584
00:50:01,680 --> 00:50:04,679
That dastard..

585
00:50:05,280 --> 00:50:08,399
...will not be able to breathe!

586
00:50:09,240 --> 00:50:10,719
-Boran.
-My Bey.

587
00:50:11,080 --> 00:50:12,839
Send word to Gencer Bey.

588
00:50:13,120 --> 00:50:15,039
We will inspect the borders.

589
00:50:15,040 --> 00:50:16,719
He should arrive as soon as possible.

590
00:50:16,720 --> 00:50:17,879
As you command my Bey.

591
00:50:37,320 --> 00:50:39,319
You are always alone, Karesi Bey.

592
00:50:39,640 --> 00:50:41,079
You are standing alone.

593
00:50:41,080 --> 00:50:43,319
We are the soldiers of the sea.

594
00:50:44,040 --> 00:50:47,359
Those who live on the seas
are used to being lonely.

595
00:51:02,600 --> 00:51:05,159
Now tell me, what's the reason...

596
00:51:05,280 --> 00:51:07,159
...for your visit?

597
00:51:08,600 --> 00:51:12,119
I have a new plan against Osman.

598
00:51:12,480 --> 00:51:14,159
That will destroy him...

599
00:51:14,920 --> 00:51:17,199
...completely.

600
00:51:18,920 --> 00:51:20,959
I am listening.

601
00:51:21,160 --> 00:51:26,359
Until today, all the beylics
made wrong moves.

602
00:51:27,800 --> 00:51:31,079
They tried to make Osman
pledge loyalty by forcing him.

603
00:51:31,440 --> 00:51:35,359
But he is a man who is not afraid of death.

604
00:51:36,240 --> 00:51:38,999
You can't make him kneel by fighting.

605
00:51:39,400 --> 00:51:40,719
But..

606
00:51:41,720 --> 00:51:46,399
...if you cut his arms,
he will fall slowly.

607
00:51:47,520 --> 00:51:48,519
Cut them!

608
00:51:49,080 --> 00:51:50,479
Cut them then!

609
00:51:50,480 --> 00:51:52,559
Do it! what are you waiting for?

610
00:51:54,600 --> 00:51:57,319
I will cut them, Karesi Bey.

611
00:51:57,880 --> 00:52:00,039
But with you.

612
00:52:00,840 --> 00:52:02,599
Together with you.

613
00:52:02,680 --> 00:52:08,079
While the Greek rebellion, we
will start in Osman's lands spread...

614
00:52:08,520 --> 00:52:11,519
...it will provoke Turkish people as well.

615
00:52:12,920 --> 00:52:16,839
The civil war in his lands..

616
00:52:17,000 --> 00:52:21,839
..will weaken him.

617
00:52:22,360 --> 00:52:23,719
You...

618
00:52:24,720 --> 00:52:28,599
...will take his Beys.

619
00:52:28,800 --> 00:52:32,319
And I will take Karadin castle back.

620
00:52:33,760 --> 00:52:35,839
Great!

621
00:52:36,160 --> 00:52:38,879
A great...

622
00:52:39,040 --> 00:52:40,879
...plan.

623
00:52:41,040 --> 00:52:44,439
I will support you with
all my power Lucas.

624
00:52:44,600 --> 00:52:48,639
Tell me what to do.

625
00:52:49,080 --> 00:52:52,839
Osman will increase
security in my borders.

626
00:52:53,120 --> 00:52:56,679
But he doesn't suspect you.

627
00:52:57,160 --> 00:52:59,719
What I want from you is...

628
00:53:00,040 --> 00:53:03,839
...that while I am moving
my army to Karadin castle...

629
00:53:04,120 --> 00:53:07,279
...I will use your lands secretly.

630
00:53:08,720 --> 00:53:11,439
We are in this together.

631
00:53:11,600 --> 00:53:15,799
Your army can use my lands freely.

632
00:53:18,120 --> 00:53:22,879
Karesi Bey, you know, when you
fall in these lands, you get swallowed.

633
00:53:23,160 --> 00:53:27,399
But if you and I stand together...

634
00:53:27,920 --> 00:53:31,719
...no one can defeat us.

635
00:53:32,760 --> 00:53:34,119
No one can!

636
00:53:34,800 --> 00:53:36,239
My dear.

637
00:53:38,520 --> 00:53:40,559
Stop sulking, okay?

638
00:53:41,640 --> 00:53:44,239
But you are leaving me behind.

639
00:53:44,600 --> 00:53:46,439
My duty is important.

640
00:53:48,000 --> 00:53:50,079
And I am not leaving you behind.

641
00:53:50,440 --> 00:53:52,399
How could I do that?

642
00:53:53,320 --> 00:53:55,759
Look...

643
00:53:59,600 --> 00:54:02,239
...carry you right in my heart.

644
00:54:03,160 --> 00:54:05,639
Then return swiftly, father.

645
00:54:09,640 --> 00:54:10,959
I will, my girl.

646
00:54:11,680 --> 00:54:12,879
I will.

647
00:54:33,800 --> 00:54:36,839
Mekece Border

648
00:54:46,960 --> 00:54:47,999
Take a look.

649
00:55:06,800 --> 00:55:07,679
Alps!

650
00:55:08,920 --> 00:55:09,919
Take a look at them.

651
00:55:37,000 --> 00:55:37,839
Enjoy your meal.

652
00:55:41,440 --> 00:55:42,839
Enjoy your meal.

653
00:55:43,000 --> 00:55:44,119
Gencer Bey.

654
00:55:44,360 --> 00:55:45,399
Is this good?

655
00:55:46,320 --> 00:55:47,279
Osman Bey.

656
00:56:03,520 --> 00:56:05,479
Go! Go! Go!

657
00:56:14,760 --> 00:56:16,999
Osman Bey. Forgive me.

658
00:56:17,400 --> 00:56:18,599
We didn't know.

659
00:56:18,680 --> 00:56:19,679
You didn't know?

660
00:56:23,440 --> 00:56:24,759
You didn't?

661
00:56:26,000 --> 00:56:27,599
Did you hear Gencer bey?

662
00:56:28,760 --> 00:56:29,839
They didn't know.

663
00:56:30,800 --> 00:56:33,359
They didn't know we'd be here.

664
00:56:35,080 --> 00:56:35,479
My Bey.

665
00:56:35,480 --> 00:56:40,879
If you did, you wouldn't light a
fire and hunt and hang out here?

666
00:56:40,880 --> 00:56:42,319
Right?

667
00:56:43,200 --> 00:56:47,239
If you knew we'd be here..

668
00:56:48,440 --> 00:56:50,279
...you'd do your duty fully.

669
00:56:52,320 --> 00:56:53,079
Right?

670
00:56:54,240 --> 00:56:57,159
Those who fail to complete duty...

671
00:56:59,080 --> 00:57:04,239
...can't protect their
Hatun or their children.

672
00:57:05,400 --> 00:57:06,799
They can't!

673
00:57:11,840 --> 00:57:12,879
Gencer Bey.

674
00:57:14,720 --> 00:57:15,559
What is a watch?

675
00:57:19,640 --> 00:57:20,559
Boran!

676
00:57:20,560 --> 00:57:21,329
My Bey.

677
00:57:21,329 --> 00:57:22,539
What is a watch?

678
00:57:23,280 --> 00:57:25,319
Taking a watch means honor.

679
00:57:25,400 --> 00:57:26,759
An Alp's grace.

680
00:57:26,760 --> 00:57:28,359
An Alp's honor.

681
00:57:28,360 --> 00:57:29,479
His grace!

682
00:57:29,480 --> 00:57:32,439
One will stay awake unlike the rest.

683
00:57:32,680 --> 00:57:35,799
One will stay hungry when others are full.

684
00:57:36,200 --> 00:57:37,999
Soldiers need to protect the people...

685
00:57:39,160 --> 00:57:40,399
..and our state.

686
00:57:44,800 --> 00:57:45,639
But no.

687
00:57:49,200 --> 00:57:51,239
You won't protect them.

688
00:57:52,600 --> 00:57:53,959
Now get out of here.

689
00:58:09,840 --> 00:58:11,239
Gencer Bey.

690
00:58:13,360 --> 00:58:14,159
Don't...

691
00:58:17,320 --> 00:58:19,519
...be fooled ever again.

692
00:58:23,320 --> 00:58:25,959
All of us will protect
the borders together.

693
00:58:26,080 --> 00:58:27,439
As you wish my Bey.

694
00:58:34,000 --> 00:58:35,839
The wedding will happen soon.

695
00:58:35,840 --> 00:58:37,279
All of you know what to do.

696
00:58:37,600 --> 00:58:39,279
Don't make me say it again.

697
00:58:39,680 --> 00:58:41,279
Is that new honey?

698
00:58:50,200 --> 00:58:51,879
It tastes good.

699
00:58:56,120 --> 00:58:56,879
What is it?

700
00:58:57,360 --> 00:59:00,039
Welcome Hazal Hatun. 
Why are you here?

701
00:59:00,760 --> 00:59:03,399
I'm here to help Ulgen.

702
00:59:03,880 --> 00:59:07,119
No need. No need but thank you.

703
00:59:08,600 --> 00:59:09,759
Are those fruits?

704
00:59:10,320 --> 00:59:11,039
Wait hold on.

705
00:59:12,120 --> 00:59:13,079
Is it good?

706
00:59:13,080 --> 00:59:15,079
It's good sister. It is.

707
00:59:16,960 --> 00:59:20,639
Do you have to eat all
of it to know it's good?

708
00:59:20,680 --> 00:59:22,599
Take it away before they're done.

709
00:59:23,160 --> 00:59:27,919
It's all okay if you're full,
don't help us anymore.

710
00:59:27,920 --> 00:59:29,919
I'll handle it.

711
00:59:34,240 --> 00:59:36,159
She's worse than Cerkutay.

712
00:59:36,160 --> 00:59:38,079
Mother.

713
00:59:38,080 --> 00:59:40,039
Yes? What?

714
00:59:41,600 --> 00:59:43,879
I want my wedding feast
preparations to be like this too.

715
00:59:43,880 --> 00:59:45,999
Is that so? What else?

716
00:59:46,000 --> 00:59:48,359
Ayse, no one would marry you.

717
00:59:48,360 --> 00:59:51,119
You're done now Ghazi.

718
00:59:51,120 --> 00:59:52,359
Shame.

719
00:59:52,360 --> 00:59:54,439
You can't watch me Ayse.

720
00:59:54,440 --> 00:59:55,599
I'll catch you.

721
00:59:55,600 --> 00:59:57,959
You can't.

722
01:00:00,600 --> 01:00:02,319
Mother Bala.

723
01:00:02,440 --> 01:00:05,559
You are troubling
yourself too much for us.

724
01:00:05,560 --> 01:00:07,839
What are you saying girl?

725
01:00:07,840 --> 01:00:10,839
We're preparing for our son
and daughter's wedding feast.

726
01:00:10,840 --> 01:00:12,559
Bala Hatun.

727
01:00:12,960 --> 01:00:16,919
The gems and fabric we asked
for the wedding dress have arrived.

728
01:00:17,200 --> 01:00:19,519
They're all so shiny.

729
01:00:19,520 --> 01:00:21,679
Good.

730
01:00:21,960 --> 01:00:23,759
Let me see.

731
01:00:24,800 --> 01:00:27,479
Very nice.

732
01:00:27,640 --> 01:00:29,919
Holofira, girl...

733
01:00:29,920 --> 01:00:34,319
...if you want another fabric,
tell me and we'll get them.

734
01:00:36,080 --> 01:00:38,679
They're all so pretty.

735
01:00:42,880 --> 01:00:44,999
Gonca Hatun.

736
01:00:47,400 --> 01:00:49,679
Come.

737
01:00:49,680 --> 01:00:51,679
Hazal Hatun what are you doing?

738
01:00:51,680 --> 01:00:53,439
Wait.

739
01:00:55,760 --> 01:01:00,159
Bala Hatun bought such pretty
fabrics, she's clearly very generous.

740
01:01:02,400 --> 01:01:05,159
She is. She is Hazal Hatun.

741
01:01:05,440 --> 01:01:08,239
Praise be, my mother
has always been like that.

742
01:01:09,600 --> 01:01:12,639
But we have to be careful.

743
01:01:14,040 --> 01:01:16,639
Trouble has arrived here.

744
01:01:33,640 --> 01:01:36,359
Mother Bala, if you allow me...

745
01:01:37,080 --> 01:01:39,679
...I want to speak with Gonca.

746
01:01:39,840 --> 01:01:42,199
As you wish girl.

747
01:01:42,520 --> 01:01:45,799
But she's in so much
pain, I understand her.

748
01:01:45,960 --> 01:01:47,919
It's very fresh too.

749
01:01:47,920 --> 01:01:50,199
Please don't forget that okay?

750
01:01:50,560 --> 01:01:52,439
Don't worry.

751
01:02:01,200 --> 01:02:03,639
Kismet, sisters...

752
01:02:03,640 --> 01:02:07,239
...bring the fabrics to
Holofira's tent. Go on.

753
01:02:11,920 --> 01:02:13,359
My bey.

754
01:02:16,920 --> 01:02:18,199
My bey.

755
01:02:18,200 --> 01:02:19,639
There's word from Sogut.

756
01:02:19,640 --> 01:02:21,159
What is it?

757
01:02:21,160 --> 01:02:22,439
Is it something bad?

758
01:02:22,440 --> 01:02:25,199
The Greeks, they're
gathering secretly in a house.

759
01:02:25,200 --> 01:02:27,119
What are they gathering for?

760
01:02:27,120 --> 01:02:29,839
They are the powerful Greeks
that are under our rule, my bey.

761
01:02:29,840 --> 01:02:31,399
We don't know why they're gathering.

762
01:02:31,400 --> 01:02:34,999
But Sergeant Aykurt is suspicious of them.

763
01:02:37,080 --> 01:02:39,519
Something is clearly up.

764
01:02:39,520 --> 01:02:41,639
Let's go and see them there.

765
01:02:41,640 --> 01:02:43,799
Let's see why they gathered.

766
01:02:43,800 --> 01:02:45,559
Let them prepare my horse.

767
01:02:45,560 --> 01:02:46,279
As you wish my bey.

768
01:02:46,600 --> 01:02:47,679
Orhan Bey.

769
01:02:48,400 --> 01:02:50,479
I wish to come with you.

770
01:02:51,160 --> 01:02:54,199
If we don't help now then when will we?

771
01:02:54,200 --> 01:02:56,839
I wish to participate, Orhan Bey.

772
01:02:59,040 --> 01:03:01,239
Okay. Come on then.

773
01:03:07,160 --> 01:03:09,119
Gonca Hatun.

774
01:03:10,000 --> 01:03:11,999
Gonca Hatun.

775
01:03:12,280 --> 01:03:14,199
You don't see well.

776
01:03:14,200 --> 01:03:16,719
Is there something I can do for you?

777
01:03:16,720 --> 01:03:18,519
No I'm okay.

778
01:03:19,120 --> 01:03:20,799
I'll be okay.

779
01:03:22,080 --> 01:03:24,439
Thank you Begum Hatun.

780
01:03:27,720 --> 01:03:29,319
Gonca.

781
01:03:30,360 --> 01:03:32,879
Can we talk a bit?

782
01:03:37,600 --> 01:03:39,839
Holofira, leave.

783
01:03:40,800 --> 01:03:43,279
I have nothing to talk with you.

784
01:03:43,360 --> 01:03:45,799
Gonca please don't do this.

785
01:03:46,600 --> 01:03:48,719
I didn't know.

786
01:03:49,080 --> 01:03:52,239
I swear I didn't know
that she was the traitor.

787
01:03:53,880 --> 01:03:56,479
It's best that I leave you alone.

788
01:03:56,480 --> 01:03:58,799
It's clearly a family matter.

789
01:03:59,440 --> 01:04:00,959
No.

790
01:04:01,920 --> 01:04:04,159
Stay, Begum Hatun.

791
01:04:04,720 --> 01:04:07,399
Everyone knows what has happened.

792
01:04:07,920 --> 01:04:10,719
Hear what she has to say too.

793
01:04:12,000 --> 01:04:14,159
What could happen?

794
01:04:17,360 --> 01:04:19,039
Holofira.

795
01:04:20,160 --> 01:04:22,879
You caused the death of my child.

796
01:04:25,080 --> 01:04:26,519
Look.

797
01:04:28,480 --> 01:04:30,799
They're preparing a wedding.

798
01:04:31,520 --> 01:04:33,759
Please, don't talk like this.

799
01:04:34,800 --> 01:04:37,399
You are my sister.

800
01:04:41,960 --> 01:04:44,679
-And when I heard that...
-What?

801
01:04:45,920 --> 01:04:48,719
When you heard that, what did you do?

802
01:04:48,920 --> 01:04:54,319
Did you get upset so much,
Holofira? Tell me! You got upset?

803
01:04:55,800 --> 01:05:00,199
What you said is true. You were my sister.

804
01:05:00,440 --> 01:05:02,959
You were my closest sister.

805
01:05:03,760 --> 01:05:07,639
You made me sit at the
table with the killer of my child.

806
01:05:12,600 --> 01:05:17,039
For this, my pain never goes away.

807
01:05:17,680 --> 01:05:19,559
My hatred never goes away.

808
01:05:19,640 --> 01:05:23,999
When I see you, my pain
increases, don't you see it, Holofira?

809
01:05:25,400 --> 01:05:29,119
Kill me, then. Stop your pain.

810
01:05:38,240 --> 01:05:40,159
If you were my enemy...

811
01:05:42,080 --> 01:05:46,399
..I wouldn't wait a
second and take your life.

812
01:05:49,560 --> 01:05:54,559
But you were my sister, Holofira!
You were my closest sister!

813
01:05:55,120 --> 01:05:58,759
I didn't only bury my child that day...

814
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:02,159
..I also buried you.

815
01:06:03,960 --> 01:06:06,159
Never forget this.

816
01:06:25,200 --> 01:06:29,759
Look at that black widow!
So, you've made your choice!

817
01:06:39,160 --> 01:06:41,799
Holofira Hatun, my daughter!

818
01:06:42,200 --> 01:06:44,639
Don't be sad, come on.

819
01:06:44,720 --> 01:06:46,719
You did nothing wrong.

820
01:06:47,000 --> 01:06:50,119
I'm not upset for myself, Hazal Hatun.

821
01:06:52,600 --> 01:06:55,079
Gonca is in great pain.

822
01:06:55,440 --> 01:06:56,759
That's why I'm upset.

823
01:06:56,800 --> 01:07:01,399
She is in pain but she also
ruins your most happy day.

824
01:07:01,520 --> 01:07:03,359
That's wrong.

825
01:07:04,280 --> 01:07:08,399
Come on, don't be sad.
The tailors are waiting for you.

826
01:07:14,320 --> 01:07:17,279
BAYHAN BEY BORDER LINE

827
01:07:28,440 --> 01:07:30,279
We'll go on foot.

828
01:07:30,400 --> 01:07:34,159
Bayhan Bey is waiting for us. Let's
see what's going on in his borders

829
01:07:34,280 --> 01:07:35,999
Come on, Alps!

830
01:07:53,960 --> 01:07:55,359
Stop!

831
01:07:59,240 --> 01:08:00,599
Who are you?

832
01:08:00,960 --> 01:08:02,439
Where are you going?

833
01:08:02,680 --> 01:08:04,639
Get out of the way.

834
01:08:05,760 --> 01:08:07,919
You can't beat us.

835
01:08:10,880 --> 01:08:12,399
Alps!

836
01:08:34,720 --> 01:08:36,679
Now, I can beat you.

837
01:08:36,840 --> 01:08:40,158
I'm asking one last time! Who are you?

838
01:08:47,120 --> 01:08:48,879
Alps!

839
01:08:49,160 --> 01:08:50,799
This is Bayhan Bey!

840
01:08:51,479 --> 01:08:56,037
Attention, whom you see is Osman Bey!

841
01:09:08,200 --> 01:09:09,919
May you live long.

842
01:09:10,640 --> 01:09:12,719
May you live long, warriors.

843
01:09:14,560 --> 01:09:19,999
We need such warriors, who
takes responsibility on their duty.

844
01:09:20,200 --> 01:09:21,839
May you live long.

845
01:09:22,920 --> 01:09:27,919
We need to send these
bold warriors across our lands.

846
01:09:29,040 --> 01:09:31,519
-Bayhan Bey -My Bey.

847
01:09:33,359 --> 01:09:35,519
May you live long, too.

848
01:09:36,240 --> 01:09:40,599
You trained them well. They
keep their duties perfectly.

849
01:09:41,200 --> 01:09:44,359
We are always on our duty, my Bey.

850
01:09:46,279 --> 01:09:47,839
Thank you.

851
01:09:49,120 --> 01:09:52,799
Now, Karadin is next.

852
01:09:55,120 --> 01:09:56,759
Let's inspect...

853
01:09:57,399 --> 01:10:00,879
...Begum Hatun's borders.

854
01:10:11,760 --> 01:10:14,479
I wish I had not given you that halwa.

855
01:10:14,800 --> 01:10:17,279
I haven't been able
to sleep since that day.

856
01:10:19,480 --> 01:10:22,239
You are not at fault, Begum Hatun.

857
01:10:22,680 --> 01:10:24,719
Those who are at fault are obvious.

858
01:10:25,480 --> 01:10:28,159
But no one can see them.
They don't want to see them.

859
01:10:28,400 --> 01:10:32,179
The one who brought the traitor into
the tribe is just as guilty as the traitor.

860
01:10:34,560 --> 01:10:36,919
Seeing Holofira is
reminding you of bad things.

861
01:10:36,920 --> 01:10:39,399
And they are holding a wedding.

862
01:10:39,800 --> 01:10:41,319
Well..

863
01:10:41,760 --> 01:10:43,999
..it hurts me.

864
01:10:45,680 --> 01:10:48,079
What strangers understand...

865
01:10:48,840 --> 01:10:51,039
...is not understood by my beloved ones.

866
01:10:51,640 --> 01:10:54,199
Neither my mother, nor my husband...

867
01:10:55,560 --> 01:10:57,959
..can see the state I am in.

868
01:10:59,840 --> 01:11:02,479
They can't choose.

869
01:11:02,840 --> 01:11:05,679
Orhan Bey is behind Holofira after all.

870
01:11:06,720 --> 01:11:08,839
It looks like...

871
01:11:09,320 --> 01:11:12,479
...I have nothing but my
baby's grave in his tribe.

872
01:11:13,760 --> 01:11:15,319
No.

873
01:11:16,400 --> 01:11:17,639
Gonca.

874
01:11:18,600 --> 01:11:21,319
Don't be like this.

875
01:11:22,080 --> 01:11:23,879
You are powerful.

876
01:11:24,440 --> 01:11:26,679
But you are not alone.

877
01:11:27,400 --> 01:11:28,759
I am with you.

878
01:11:29,280 --> 01:11:31,199
Think of me as your sister.

879
01:11:32,360 --> 01:11:36,039
No matter what you need, no
matter whom you are against...

880
01:11:36,560 --> 01:11:39,119
...know that I'll always support you.

881
01:11:45,000 --> 01:11:46,279
Gonca.

882
01:11:48,600 --> 01:11:49,418
Mother.

883
01:11:49,430 --> 01:11:51,919
I wanted to come to
see if you are doing okay.

884
01:11:52,800 --> 01:11:54,359
I am okay, mother.

885
01:11:57,920 --> 01:12:01,199
I didn't know you were here, Begum Hatun.

886
01:12:01,840 --> 01:12:05,119
I wanted to have a chat with Gonca Hatun.

887
01:12:05,640 --> 01:12:07,439
You thought well.

888
01:12:07,640 --> 01:12:09,919
But...

889
01:12:10,600 --> 01:12:13,319
..now Gonca needs to rest.

890
01:12:15,680 --> 01:12:18,719
We should talk a little, huh?

891
01:12:30,200 --> 01:12:32,559
People!

892
01:12:33,920 --> 01:12:36,879
Repair and wash everything!

893
01:12:37,360 --> 01:12:39,599
Shine everything!

894
01:12:39,880 --> 01:12:43,039
Come with me. Come on!

895
01:12:43,760 --> 01:12:47,199
At the seat of every Bey, there will be...

896
01:12:48,560 --> 01:12:51,719
...pieces from their beylics.

897
01:12:52,120 --> 01:12:56,519
For example, in Karesi Bey's seat...

898
01:13:04,360 --> 01:13:06,199
...there will be a...

899
01:13:07,600 --> 01:13:09,759
...big sea shell.

900
01:13:10,200 --> 01:13:11,599
Come on!

901
01:13:12,480 --> 01:13:16,759
Don't place the banners there!

902
01:13:17,080 --> 01:13:18,799
Begum Hatun.

903
01:13:20,640 --> 01:13:23,519
You must be feeling a
guilty conscience as you...

904
01:13:23,520 --> 01:13:26,439
...are treating Gonca kindly.

905
01:13:26,800 --> 01:13:30,359
There is no ill intentions
behind it, right?

906
01:13:31,160 --> 01:13:35,199
I didn't want her to feel alone.

907
01:13:35,200 --> 01:13:37,999
Gonca is my daughter, Begum Hatun.

908
01:13:39,200 --> 01:13:42,359
So, she is not alone!

909
01:13:43,000 --> 01:13:45,879
She is no different than
Alaeddin, Orhan and Fatma...

910
01:13:46,120 --> 01:13:47,199
...in my eyes.

911
01:13:48,000 --> 01:13:49,639
Just like Holofira.

912
01:13:50,480 --> 01:13:52,039
She is going through hard times.

913
01:13:53,160 --> 01:13:55,359
She is, but...

914
01:13:55,960 --> 01:13:59,759
...if anyone tries to take advantage
of that and poison her mind...

915
01:14:00,120 --> 01:14:03,399
...against her family and beloved ones...

916
01:14:04,400 --> 01:14:06,119
...they will pay heavily for it!

917
01:14:07,680 --> 01:14:10,919
I just wanted to console her.

918
01:14:10,920 --> 01:14:12,399
Thanks.

919
01:14:12,600 --> 01:14:14,759
Thanks, but...

920
01:14:15,520 --> 01:14:17,599
...like I said before.

921
01:14:18,480 --> 01:14:21,919
Just focus on your duty.

922
01:14:32,680 --> 01:14:34,079
Begum Hatun.

923
01:14:41,800 --> 01:14:44,479
Prepare the horses. We'll head out soon.

924
01:14:50,040 --> 01:14:50,999
Bala Hatun.

925
01:14:58,920 --> 01:15:02,239
I'll always be on top of my duty.

926
01:15:02,760 --> 01:15:06,879
I'd never disappoint Osman Bey.

927
01:15:10,920 --> 01:15:15,239
I wish for that to be true Begum Hatun.

928
01:15:16,320 --> 01:15:17,999
It happened once.

929
01:15:19,920 --> 01:15:22,919
I wouldn't want you to mess it all up..

930
01:15:23,440 --> 01:15:24,559
...once again.

931
01:15:38,760 --> 01:15:41,319
They gathered here last night Shehzade.

932
01:15:41,680 --> 01:15:43,479
Why did they gather here Aykurt?

933
01:15:43,960 --> 01:15:45,159
Did you find out?

934
01:15:45,320 --> 01:15:47,119
I asked around but..

935
01:15:47,640 --> 01:15:49,239
...I haven't heard anything.

936
01:15:51,000 --> 01:15:52,919
The Greek people Osman Bey protects...

937
01:15:54,360 --> 01:15:56,519
...gathered together at night.

938
01:15:58,160 --> 01:15:59,719
And no one knows about it?

939
01:16:00,160 --> 01:16:01,479
Something's off.

940
01:16:02,440 --> 01:16:03,239
Shehzade.

941
01:16:03,960 --> 01:16:06,239
Let's question them.
-No.

942
01:16:06,920 --> 01:16:08,559
The water's muddy.

943
01:16:08,760 --> 01:16:12,079
We need the water to be
clear to find out what's wrong.

944
01:16:14,360 --> 01:16:15,639
But...

945
01:16:16,920 --> 01:16:18,879
..let's show them we're on to them.

946
01:16:26,840 --> 01:16:30,679
When the swords get to innocent Greeks...

947
01:16:31,360 --> 01:16:34,399
..it'll turn them into an angry army.

948
01:16:34,520 --> 01:16:37,279
Your men will be among the Greeks.

949
01:16:37,280 --> 01:16:39,039
They'll cause chaos.

950
01:16:39,040 --> 01:16:40,079
Good.

951
01:16:41,280 --> 01:16:45,199
Soon, the fire of
hell will start in Sogut.

952
01:16:50,120 --> 01:16:51,239
Open up!

953
01:17:01,880 --> 01:17:02,559
Break it.

954
01:17:08,800 --> 01:17:09,519
Orhan Bey.

955
01:17:09,520 --> 01:17:10,839
Merchant Marco.

956
01:17:12,000 --> 01:17:12,799
What is it?

957
01:17:13,320 --> 01:17:14,679
Why are you late?

958
01:17:14,960 --> 01:17:16,479
Is there a problem?

959
01:17:16,680 --> 01:17:19,999
Forgive me Orhan Bey. 
I was busy. I didn't know about it.

960
01:17:20,680 --> 01:17:21,999
It's okay.

961
01:17:22,280 --> 01:17:23,999
Merchant Marco.

962
01:17:24,360 --> 01:17:27,279
Yesterday Alps let a criminal get away.

963
01:17:27,720 --> 01:17:31,919
They saw Greek merchants here
when they left to look for him.

964
01:17:36,120 --> 01:17:37,959
I wanted to ask you myself.

965
01:17:39,440 --> 01:17:42,319
Are the Greek merchants in trouble?

966
01:17:43,200 --> 01:17:45,879
Everyone prays for Osman Bey, Orhan Bey.

967
01:17:46,280 --> 01:17:49,759
We gathered together to help the orphans.

968
01:17:49,760 --> 01:17:52,239
To show your good faith...

969
01:17:52,920 --> 01:17:55,039
...you gather aid from everyone.

970
01:17:58,360 --> 01:17:59,119
Okay.

971
01:18:01,000 --> 01:18:02,279
Thank you.

972
01:18:03,920 --> 01:18:06,719
We're still looking for
the criminal on the run.

973
01:18:07,000 --> 01:18:09,279
All the houses will be searched.

974
01:18:09,560 --> 01:18:11,279
Can we come in?

975
01:18:11,280 --> 01:18:13,279
Alps need to take a look.

976
01:18:16,200 --> 01:18:16,999
Come in.

977
01:18:19,120 --> 01:18:20,119
Aykurt.

978
01:18:32,880 --> 01:18:33,879
Shut the door.

979
01:18:47,160 --> 01:18:48,719
They're for innocent orphans.

980
01:19:01,840 --> 01:19:04,399
Shehzade. There's no criminal inside.

981
01:19:11,240 --> 01:19:13,039
Merchant Marco.

982
01:19:13,040 --> 01:19:16,719
I'll send word to the
masters to help your charity.

983
01:19:17,640 --> 01:19:18,999
Thank you Orhan Bey.

984
01:19:19,360 --> 01:19:21,599
Thank you Merchant Marco.

985
01:19:21,720 --> 01:19:23,239
Thank you.

986
01:19:27,160 --> 01:19:28,039
Aykurt.

987
01:19:28,040 --> 01:19:30,279
There's nothing suspicious inside, Shehzade.

988
01:19:30,560 --> 01:19:31,399
What?

989
01:19:31,920 --> 01:19:33,399
Was he honest?

990
01:19:33,840 --> 01:19:34,999
It seems so.

991
01:19:35,720 --> 01:19:38,439
They're doing charity to show good will.

992
01:19:38,640 --> 01:19:41,559
But no one knows about it.

993
01:19:42,320 --> 01:19:43,999
Aykurt.

994
01:19:44,120 --> 01:19:46,599
Tell the alps to keep
their eyes on this house.

995
01:19:46,600 --> 01:19:49,359
Something else is going on in there.

996
01:20:08,960 --> 01:20:09,799
Stop.

997
01:20:09,800 --> 01:20:11,399
I'm coming from Nikea.

998
01:20:11,400 --> 01:20:15,439
The Lord of Nikea has
send these horses for...

999
01:20:15,440 --> 01:20:16,919
...commander Lucas' powerful soldiers.

1000
01:20:16,920 --> 01:20:19,519
Show me your papers.

1001
01:20:20,080 --> 01:20:25,599
When you enter Bursa they
will definitely ask for your papers.

1002
01:20:25,960 --> 01:20:29,559
Search the person
responsible for the horses well.

1003
01:20:50,120 --> 01:20:53,319
We were waiting for you, you may enter.

1004
01:21:08,720 --> 01:21:12,319
-Welcome Osman Bey.
-Welcome my bey.

1005
01:21:12,320 --> 01:21:15,119
-Welcome Osman Bey.
-Welcome bey.

1006
01:21:15,120 --> 01:21:18,519
-Welcome.
-Thank you.

1007
01:21:21,560 --> 01:21:23,839
What is it Begum Hatun?

1008
01:21:23,920 --> 01:21:26,319
We've been going around for a while...

1009
01:21:26,320 --> 01:21:27,879
...but...

1010
01:21:27,880 --> 01:21:30,599
...we didn't see anyone but women.

1011
01:21:30,600 --> 01:21:35,159
Neither a guard or a
man that can use a sword.

1012
01:21:35,520 --> 01:21:40,319
Is this how you guard this place?

1013
01:21:40,920 --> 01:21:42,719
The Sisters!

1014
01:21:59,160 --> 01:22:00,319
There.

1015
01:22:00,320 --> 01:22:03,959
This is how I'm guarding
the grounds, Osman Bey.

1016
01:22:04,920 --> 01:22:09,599
So you make them these
clothes and do their jobs...

1017
01:22:09,880 --> 01:22:11,439
Alright.

1018
01:22:11,720 --> 01:22:13,919
You thought well, Begum Hatun.

1019
01:22:13,920 --> 01:22:17,384
We'll always follow you
on the path you opened up for us...

1020
01:22:17,396 --> 01:22:20,799
...with our wits
and swords, Osman Bey.

1021
01:22:21,080 --> 01:22:23,239
We started it all risking our lives...

1022
01:22:23,240 --> 01:22:24,919
...there's no going back now.

1023
01:22:24,920 --> 01:22:27,799
Thank you. Live long.

1024
01:22:29,440 --> 01:22:33,319
You sit there and act like
the mother of this nation...

1025
01:22:33,600 --> 01:22:38,359
But I swear I'm going to take
everything you have from you Bala.

1026
01:22:38,360 --> 01:22:39,799
Everything.

1027
01:22:40,560 --> 01:22:42,319
Both your place...

1028
01:22:43,360 --> 01:22:45,519
..and your husband.

1029
01:22:51,320 --> 01:22:56,879
Osman has upped the
security in these areas.

1030
01:22:57,880 --> 01:23:02,519
We have to find another
path for Lucas' army.

1031
01:23:10,880 --> 01:23:12,879
Karesi Bey.

1032
01:23:16,040 --> 01:23:18,599
What is it Karesi Bey?

1033
01:23:19,680 --> 01:23:21,719
Why am I seeing you again for?

1034
01:23:21,720 --> 01:23:27,559
We were looking for a bey whose
blood runs as wild as this river...

1035
01:23:27,560 --> 01:23:32,359
...but destiny made me
come across you, again.

1036
01:23:32,360 --> 01:23:34,559
No.

1037
01:23:36,240 --> 01:23:38,799
You don't come and..

1038
01:23:38,800 --> 01:23:41,319
..see me without a reason

1039
01:23:41,360 --> 01:23:45,519
Now tell me, are you trying to build...

1040
01:23:46,160 --> 01:23:48,119
...the bridge you couldn't
make Lucas build?

1041
01:23:48,120 --> 01:23:51,479
This side of this river is mine...

1042
01:23:51,480 --> 01:23:55,199
...and those lands are yours.

1043
01:23:55,400 --> 01:23:59,079
As long as you're this disrespectful...

1044
01:23:59,360 --> 01:24:02,719
...and rebel against your elders...

1045
01:24:02,720 --> 01:24:06,479
...even a bridge cannot connect us!

1046
01:24:06,680 --> 01:24:10,119
When I told you to unite,
you separated our ways.

1047
01:24:11,200 --> 01:24:15,599
You worked with the infidels
against your own blood.

1048
01:24:16,200 --> 01:24:19,319
That neither..

1049
01:24:19,440 --> 01:24:21,159
...deserves respect nor manners.

1050
01:24:21,160 --> 01:24:23,838
Am I working with the
infidels just because...

1051
01:24:23,850 --> 01:24:26,479
...I made an agreement
in terms of trade with them?

1052
01:24:26,480 --> 01:24:28,279
Osman Bey.

1053
01:24:28,920 --> 01:24:31,199
I know what you do..

1054
01:24:31,200 --> 01:24:33,919
...and why you do it very well.

1055
01:24:39,760 --> 01:24:43,319
Instead of working
with the powerful ones...

1056
01:24:43,480 --> 01:24:50,519
...you are screaming
everywhere that you are a Bey.

1057
01:24:50,760 --> 01:24:52,359
You are afraid.

1058
01:24:55,000 --> 01:24:56,559
I am afraid, huh?

1059
01:24:57,280 --> 01:24:58,679
Of you?

1060
01:24:58,720 --> 01:25:03,710
Of all of us. You are wandering
on all the borders in order to figure

1061
01:25:03,722 --> 01:25:08,439
out from where those powerful
ones are going to attack, Black Osma

1062
01:25:08,600 --> 01:25:12,199
You are the one coming our way.

1063
01:25:12,400 --> 01:25:15,359
For you keep your
enemy in your eyesight...

1064
01:25:16,640 --> 01:25:19,079
..it is obvious who is afraid.

1065
01:25:19,400 --> 01:25:23,439
Karasi Bey doesn't keep
his enemy in his eyesight.

1066
01:25:23,480 --> 01:25:27,039
All of them are under the ground!

1067
01:25:28,200 --> 01:25:33,919
But you will be always
in my eyesight, Osman.

1068
01:25:34,120 --> 01:25:37,919
When the time comes, you will obey me.

1069
01:25:38,120 --> 01:25:44,119
Then, you will be my
favorite Bey, warrior...

1070
01:25:44,760 --> 01:25:48,119
...and someone closer than my son.

1071
01:25:48,280 --> 01:25:50,399
All these wars...

1072
01:25:51,480 --> 01:25:53,599
...have made you go mad.

1073
01:25:56,600 --> 01:25:59,119
Anyone can see it since you are
attending the weddings of the infidel

1074
01:25:59,200 --> 01:26:03,439
We've also received your
invitation, Osman Bey.

1075
01:26:04,880 --> 01:26:06,799
I'll come.

1076
01:26:07,600 --> 01:26:14,159
I'll join the wedding of your son,
Orhan Bey. We've prepared our gift

1077
01:26:21,480 --> 01:26:26,319
As you commanded, I've placed
my men in Sogut, Commander Luka

1078
01:26:26,440 --> 01:26:31,439
We'll start the fire of the
rebellion from every corner.

1079
01:26:32,360 --> 01:26:38,399
Invincible Arkadeus. I knew I
didn't make a mistake by trusting you.

1080
01:26:39,800 --> 01:26:41,759
Is everything ready?

1081
01:26:41,920 --> 01:26:45,279
The weapons have been
hidden in the houses.

1082
01:26:45,520 --> 01:26:49,039
My men have been placed on crucial points.

1083
01:26:49,120 --> 01:26:55,839
We've infiltrated among the people in
such a way that even the quietest one is...

1084
01:26:56,120 --> 01:27:02,879
..going to find himself 
in the middle of the rebellion

1085
01:27:03,480 --> 01:27:04,999
Good.

1086
01:27:05,200 --> 01:27:08,993
They'll drown in a
greater chaos in Orhan's wedding...

1087
01:27:09,005 --> 01:27:12,119
...than you had in 
your wedding.

1088
01:27:15,520 --> 01:27:18,873
I'm so proud that I
have a commander like you

1089
01:27:18,885 --> 01:27:22,319
by my side while fighting
for Holy Rome, Arkadeus.

1090
01:27:23,360 --> 01:27:25,399
The victor will be ours in the end.

1091
01:27:25,560 --> 01:27:28,919
I'm at your side with my
all power, Commander.

1092
01:27:29,080 --> 01:27:33,599
There is no suspicion that the
victory will be with Byzantine.

1093
01:27:34,680 --> 01:27:39,719
Don't forget that you are
the torch of this rebellion.

1094
01:27:41,600 --> 01:27:44,719
Go now. Lead your soldiers.

1095
01:27:53,080 --> 01:27:56,119
KAYI TRIBE

1096
01:28:06,480 --> 01:28:09,039
-May it be easy.
-Thank you, Fatma Hatun.

1097
01:28:09,080 --> 01:28:11,559
-Thank you.
-They look great, sisters.

1098
01:28:11,640 --> 01:28:14,879
-Thank you.
-Welcome.

1099
01:28:29,640 --> 01:28:31,479
Fatma Hatun.

1100
01:28:41,840 --> 01:28:44,919
Orhan Bey and Holofira Hatun
have come together finally.

1101
01:28:45,680 --> 01:28:48,919
Their love is legendary.
I hope the other lovers...

1102
01:28:51,720 --> 01:28:55,919
I'm happy for them. I hope their
happiness lasts forever, if Allah permits.

1103
01:28:56,000 --> 01:29:02,039
Wouldn't it be more suitable if you
congratulate Orhan Bey in person, Sarica Bey?

1104
01:29:12,880 --> 01:29:16,399
Are you going to keep
standing like this? Let me pass.

1105
01:29:16,480 --> 01:29:22,319
Sorry, Fatma Hatun. I was checking
if there is anything I could help with.

1106
01:29:23,200 --> 01:29:27,719
I don't know for what
reason Yusuf Bey is here.

1107
01:29:29,440 --> 01:29:33,119
I am here because I wish to speak
with you in person, Fatma Hatun.

1108
01:29:33,400 --> 01:29:37,039
Of course, if you allow
me. That's why I'm here.

1109
01:29:37,200 --> 01:29:39,159
What are you going to talk about?

1110
01:29:39,280 --> 01:29:43,439
I heard that Bala Hatun
assigned you to the warrior sisters.

1111
01:29:43,960 --> 01:29:47,959
We have also many
sisters who can fight, for sure.

1112
01:29:48,080 --> 01:29:51,839
But I'm sure your organization
will be more suitable for our army.

1113
01:29:56,160 --> 01:29:58,599
Well, talking about unity...

1114
01:29:59,840 --> 01:30:03,719
...Praise be Yusuf Bey,
you always work hard.

1115
01:30:04,960 --> 01:30:06,919
Right?

1116
01:30:10,600 --> 01:30:12,719
I will talk with my mother first.

1117
01:30:12,880 --> 01:30:14,936
If she sees it fit, you
can bring the hatuns

1118
01:30:14,948 --> 01:30:16,879
to the military camp
and we can test them.

1119
01:30:17,360 --> 01:30:20,879
Those who are suited to be
a member of The Sisters can be given duties.

1120
01:30:21,440 --> 01:30:23,399
Good, Fatma Hatun.

1121
01:30:29,560 --> 01:30:31,319
Fatma Hatun!

1122
01:30:31,840 --> 01:30:33,639
You go to the training yard.

1123
01:30:33,640 --> 01:30:35,239
Fatma Hatun!

1124
01:30:35,240 --> 01:30:38,719
There is little time left. They
are waiting for you for henna.

1125
01:30:39,200 --> 01:30:41,519
I am coming Ghazi.

1126
01:30:50,760 --> 01:30:51,919
Come on.

1127
01:30:57,400 --> 01:30:58,999
Fatma Hatun.

1128
01:31:01,960 --> 01:31:04,039
What do they want?

1129
01:31:06,240 --> 01:31:08,239
I am going to attack them with my swords!

1130
01:31:08,240 --> 01:31:11,919
Don't do that. I can take care of my own.

1131
01:31:20,520 --> 01:31:22,359
Ghazi.

1132
01:31:22,360 --> 01:31:23,879
Let go of me Fatma Hatun.

1133
01:31:25,640 --> 01:31:28,159
Ghazi come here.

1134
01:31:28,920 --> 01:31:29,799
Ghazi.

1135
01:31:30,720 --> 01:31:33,039
Ghazi Come on.

1136
01:31:38,840 --> 01:31:39,759
The Sisters, huh?

1137
01:31:42,080 --> 01:31:44,119
I know what you want Yusuf Bey.

1138
01:31:45,200 --> 01:31:47,519
You won't get what you want.

1139
01:31:47,960 --> 01:31:49,479
Here's my advice.

1140
01:31:49,880 --> 01:31:52,319
Don't you dare fight me in any field.

1141
01:31:53,840 --> 01:31:55,439
You'll lose.

1142
01:32:02,040 --> 01:32:03,199
You're wrong Yusuf Bey.

1143
01:32:04,280 --> 01:32:07,119
Look at the bride

1144
01:32:07,680 --> 01:32:10,999
She has henna on her hands.

1145
01:32:11,320 --> 01:32:14,479
Her hands so soft...

1146
01:32:14,960 --> 01:32:18,039
..her heart so true.

1147
01:32:18,560 --> 01:32:21,679
In the name of Allah.

1148
01:32:22,080 --> 01:32:25,239
..her heart so true.

1149
01:32:25,760 --> 01:32:28,919
Her door is adorned with henna.

1150
01:32:29,480 --> 01:32:32,719
And her form is angelic.

1151
01:32:33,000 --> 01:32:34,199
Bring it here my girl.

1152
01:32:34,200 --> 01:32:37,119
Congratulations, sweet bride.

1153
01:32:37,120 --> 01:32:40,319
May your home be a happy one.

1154
01:32:44,120 --> 01:32:45,079
Come on.

1155
01:32:49,920 --> 01:32:52,399
In the name of Allah.

1156
01:32:55,840 --> 01:32:57,599
My daughter.

1157
01:32:57,960 --> 01:33:00,199
My beautiful Holofira.

1158
01:33:00,480 --> 01:33:05,159
May Allah wish you and my Orhan
happiness in both worlds, if Allah permits.

1159
01:33:05,160 --> 01:33:07,359
-Ameen.
-Ameen.

1160
01:33:07,520 --> 01:33:09,359
Ameen.

1161
01:33:09,440 --> 01:33:11,759
Fatma Hatun.

1162
01:33:11,760 --> 01:33:14,719
May you experience it next.

1163
01:33:19,680 --> 01:33:21,839
That's right.

1164
01:33:22,240 --> 01:33:27,399
If Allah permits, with a man that is
worthy of your bloodline and you.

1165
01:33:40,000 --> 01:33:41,519
Gonca.

1166
01:33:42,800 --> 01:33:45,279
I couldn't make it in time for the henna.

1167
01:33:46,120 --> 01:33:48,839
I'm sorry.

1168
01:34:26,040 --> 01:34:28,039
This is my wedding gift for you.

1169
01:34:31,200 --> 01:34:33,159
It belonged to my baby.

1170
01:34:39,640 --> 01:34:44,479
First, his father's
blood got spilled on it.

1171
01:34:46,360 --> 01:34:50,559
I didn't know then but it
was a sign for my baby.

1172
01:34:52,880 --> 01:34:56,119
I'll never forget that you caused this.

1173
01:34:58,840 --> 01:35:01,279
You also never forget.

1174
01:35:16,200 --> 01:35:17,959
My beautiful Holofira.

1175
01:35:18,160 --> 01:35:21,759
Daughter, no, no, no. Don't be upset.

1176
01:35:21,960 --> 01:35:24,759
Don't be sad, huh.

1177
01:35:24,840 --> 01:35:29,199
This is the happiest day of my life.
Come on.

1178
01:35:32,680 --> 01:35:34,399
KAYI TRIBE

1179
01:35:41,650 --> 01:35:44,369
Attention! Osman Bey!

1180
01:36:00,600 --> 01:36:02,039
Peace be with you.

1181
01:36:02,040 --> 01:36:04,159
Peace be upon you.

1182
01:36:06,640 --> 01:36:09,319
My Beys who are always ready for war.

1183
01:36:10,640 --> 01:36:12,759
Welcome.

1184
01:36:13,320 --> 01:36:16,159
You have traveled from far away.

1185
01:36:16,720 --> 01:36:21,359
You have come from
the tribes in the borders.

1186
01:36:22,520 --> 01:36:24,559
I welcome you all.

1187
01:36:24,560 --> 01:36:27,039
-Thank you Osman Bey.
-Thank you Osman Bey.

1188
01:36:27,040 --> 01:36:28,279
Thank you.

1189
01:36:33,200 --> 01:36:36,199
Come on then.

1190
01:36:37,600 --> 01:36:40,159
My Bey, Karesi Bey.

1191
01:36:51,680 --> 01:36:53,599
Peace be with you.

1192
01:36:54,840 --> 01:36:57,039
Peace be upon you.

1193
01:36:57,240 --> 01:37:00,119
You have invited us
as our younger brother.

1194
01:37:00,840 --> 01:37:03,839
And as your elder..

1195
01:37:05,160 --> 01:37:07,599
...I came to your son's wedding.

1196
01:37:08,360 --> 01:37:11,439
May Allah bless their marriage.

1197
01:37:17,040 --> 01:37:18,839
Well..

1198
01:37:19,560 --> 01:37:22,969
...there can't be a wedding
without Karesi Bey, right?

1199
01:37:23,520 --> 01:37:24,759
Thank you.

1200
01:37:25,800 --> 01:37:27,359
Karesi Bey.

1201
01:37:28,480 --> 01:37:29,759
The best...

1202
01:37:32,000 --> 01:37:34,639
...seat is yours.

1203
01:37:40,600 --> 01:37:44,759
Please take your seats.

1204
01:37:59,320 --> 01:38:02,639
Greek people, my brothers!

1205
01:38:03,240 --> 01:38:05,279
What you heard is true!

1206
01:38:05,680 --> 01:38:11,039
Turks killed our priest to kidnap
the bride from the wedding...

1207
01:38:11,560 --> 01:38:14,039
..of our commander Arcadeus!

1208
01:38:27,480 --> 01:38:29,319
They insulted...

1209
01:38:29,760 --> 01:38:32,839
...our religion and dignity!

1210
01:38:37,720 --> 01:38:41,119
We won't accept this!

1211
01:38:49,200 --> 01:38:53,439
We will take revenge
on the oppressor Turks!

1212
01:38:55,280 --> 01:39:00,759
They shed the blood of
our priest at our wedding!

1213
01:39:03,240 --> 01:39:06,839
And we will...

1214
01:39:06,840 --> 01:39:09,719
...burn down their wedding
with the fires of rebellion!

1215
01:39:12,480 --> 01:39:16,959
For The Holy Roman Empire!

1216
01:39:17,200 --> 01:39:20,279
For our religion!
-For our religion!

1217
01:39:20,440 --> 01:39:22,039
Go!

1218
01:39:26,280 --> 01:39:28,079
Burn down everything!

1219
01:39:28,080 --> 01:39:30,039
Those who...

1220
01:39:30,040 --> 01:39:33,239
...did this to us will
burn down with our fire!

1221
01:39:33,400 --> 01:39:35,639
Sergeant Aykut, should we stop them?

1222
01:39:35,640 --> 01:39:38,079
No, that would make things worse.

1223
01:39:38,080 --> 01:39:40,199
I will inform Osman Bey.

1224
01:39:40,200 --> 01:39:42,879
Don't let things get out of control.

1225
01:39:42,880 --> 01:39:43,959
As you command.

1226
01:39:44,280 --> 01:39:47,399
-You will pay!
-Burn everything!

1227
01:40:41,480 --> 01:40:42,439
Allah.

1228
01:40:42,800 --> 01:40:46,079
May this couple be like Adam and Hawaa...

1229
01:40:46,080 --> 01:40:52,359
...like Hadhrat Muhammed
(PBUH) and Mother Hatice...

1230
01:40:53,000 --> 01:40:57,039
...like Hadhrat Ali and Mother Fatma.

1231
01:40:57,840 --> 01:41:00,959
May Allah grant them love.

1232
01:41:00,960 --> 01:41:02,519
Ameen.

1233
01:41:02,520 --> 01:41:03,759
Al Fatiha.

1234
01:41:18,320 --> 01:41:19,559
Alright.

1235
01:41:25,000 --> 01:41:26,919
Congratulations.

1236
01:41:27,360 --> 01:41:29,599
May Allah never separate you.

1237
01:41:29,600 --> 01:41:31,599
If Allah permits, my Bey. Thank you.

1238
01:41:31,640 --> 01:41:33,599
Hold on.

1239
01:41:36,400 --> 01:41:38,079
Okay...

1240
01:41:53,400 --> 01:41:54,399
This...

1241
01:41:54,880 --> 01:41:56,399
...is from Osman Bey...

1242
01:41:57,040 --> 01:41:59,279
...and myself, my girl.

1243
01:41:59,400 --> 01:41:59,839
Come.

1244
01:42:01,480 --> 01:42:02,479
Come.

1245
01:42:07,960 --> 01:42:11,519
May you live long and bravely...

1246
01:42:12,520 --> 01:42:14,599
..like your father, if Allah permits.

1247
01:42:15,360 --> 01:42:17,239
Thank you Karesi Bey.

1248
01:42:27,160 --> 01:42:29,279
This is our gift to you.

1249
01:42:36,000 --> 01:42:37,199
Thank you.

1250
01:42:42,040 --> 01:42:43,559
Orhan.

1251
01:42:43,640 --> 01:42:44,959
Holofira.

1252
01:42:45,760 --> 01:42:47,999
Go on to the stage.

1253
01:42:48,320 --> 01:42:50,559
This is your Happiest day. Come on.

1254
01:42:51,400 --> 01:42:54,039
Go on and enjoy your dance.

1255
01:45:58,440 --> 01:46:00,119
Brother.

1256
01:46:01,240 --> 01:46:02,519
Sister.

1257
01:46:02,520 --> 01:46:05,999
Sister in law Gonca looks very down.

1258
01:46:06,000 --> 01:46:08,879
Maybe I can go speak with her.

1259
01:46:09,720 --> 01:46:11,719
No Fatma.

1260
01:46:12,080 --> 01:46:14,279
She wants to be alone.

1261
01:46:16,000 --> 01:46:18,639
She doesn't even want me around.

1262
01:46:20,960 --> 01:46:23,999
Her pain is grand...

1263
01:46:24,800 --> 01:46:27,719
...she even told me that we should leave.

1264
01:46:29,240 --> 01:46:33,199
So she's in that much pain.

1265
01:46:33,600 --> 01:46:36,759
It's not easy of course, losing a child...

1266
01:46:36,840 --> 01:46:38,439
It's not easy.

1267
01:46:41,880 --> 01:46:43,039
Brother.

1268
01:46:43,040 --> 01:46:45,519
How can you stand up tall?

1269
01:46:45,520 --> 01:46:47,399
A mountain would've crumbled.

1270
01:46:47,400 --> 01:46:49,919
A river would've flooded.

1271
01:46:49,920 --> 01:46:53,959
You were kept in that
cage first then lost a child.

1272
01:46:54,440 --> 01:46:57,399
How can you stand up tall?

1273
01:47:00,520 --> 01:47:04,159
Because if we show our
pain we'll crumble, Fatma.

1274
01:47:04,360 --> 01:47:06,079
So many enemies...

1275
01:47:06,080 --> 01:47:09,559
They're waiting for us to
take a stab at us in the dark.

1276
01:47:09,760 --> 01:47:12,079
If we fall...

1277
01:47:12,400 --> 01:47:15,439
...there will be a lot of people
who will stab us in the back.

1278
01:47:15,720 --> 01:47:17,319
Then...

1279
01:47:17,880 --> 01:47:20,679
...our nation would be
destroyed huh Fatma?

1280
01:47:22,520 --> 01:47:25,639
...that's why you hide it deep down.

1281
01:47:26,040 --> 01:47:28,479
You smile at everyone because of this huh?

1282
01:47:28,680 --> 01:47:30,719
For our nation..

1283
01:47:30,800 --> 01:47:33,999
...we have to risk everything.

1284
01:47:34,440 --> 01:47:37,999
No one will see the tears, we shed.

1285
01:47:40,080 --> 01:47:42,999
We'll be the strongest ones, Fatma.

1286
01:47:43,440 --> 01:47:45,799
They will hurt us.

1287
01:47:47,120 --> 01:47:49,559
They will but...

1288
01:47:51,040 --> 01:47:54,079
..we will never show weakness.

1289
01:47:54,080 --> 01:47:56,679
You're going to make me cry.

1290
01:47:56,680 --> 01:47:57,319
No.

1291
01:47:57,320 --> 01:47:59,039
My brother.

1292
01:48:02,680 --> 01:48:04,279
What happened?

1293
01:48:04,880 --> 01:48:08,079
Did you manage to charm her?

1294
01:48:10,760 --> 01:48:12,479
It's soon.

1295
01:48:12,880 --> 01:48:15,599
But we can't rush it, father.

1296
01:48:21,040 --> 01:48:22,999
-Lowlifes.
-Traitors.

1297
01:48:23,000 --> 01:48:24,999
Run.

1298
01:48:25,840 --> 01:48:27,799
Death to Turks.

1299
01:48:28,720 --> 01:48:32,959
-Traitor Turks.
-Lowlifes.

1300
01:48:34,400 --> 01:48:36,239
Burn it.

1301
01:48:37,000 --> 01:48:38,399
Revenge.

1302
01:48:38,400 --> 01:48:41,439
-Don't burn that.
-Kill them all.

1303
01:48:41,440 --> 01:48:44,599
-Please.
-Attack brothers.

1304
01:48:44,600 --> 01:48:47,239
For the great Byzantine.

1305
01:48:47,240 --> 01:48:49,239
Revenge.

1306
01:48:49,760 --> 01:48:51,399
Burn it.

1307
01:48:51,400 --> 01:48:53,399
Destroy it.

1308
01:49:07,720 --> 01:49:10,119
They call a good horse great...

1309
01:49:10,120 --> 01:49:12,559
...and a good man wild.

1310
01:49:12,920 --> 01:49:15,879
Come on lads, you have the field.

1311
01:49:16,160 --> 01:49:17,799
Come on.

1312
01:49:29,480 --> 01:49:30,919
Come on.

1313
01:51:20,960 --> 01:51:23,479
What a beautiful weather.

1314
01:51:26,040 --> 01:51:28,279
What a great scene.

1315
01:51:34,760 --> 01:51:39,559
Arkadeus. Be prepared for the next step.

1316
01:51:40,000 --> 01:51:43,559
We've received the expected
news from Karasi Bey.

1317
01:51:44,840 --> 01:51:50,479
Karasi Bey has reported from
which territory our army will pass.

1318
01:51:53,280 --> 01:51:54,959
Osman.

1319
01:51:55,600 --> 01:52:02,519
While Osman is busy with rebel attacks,
we'll get back what belongs to us.

1320
01:52:03,600 --> 01:52:05,279
Our honor.

1321
01:52:05,880 --> 01:52:10,279
I'm with you until the last
drop of my blood, commander.

1322
01:52:11,280 --> 01:52:15,679
Karadin Castle will belong
to Byzantine once again.

1323
01:52:15,880 --> 01:52:19,479
We'll deal a great blow to Osman.

1324
01:52:22,640 --> 01:52:26,843
The ones, who thought
have beaten us, will bend

1325
01:52:26,855 --> 01:52:30,719
the knee against the
greatness of Holy Rome!

1326
01:52:39,400 --> 01:52:41,399
What did my Orhan Bey do?

1327
01:52:41,440 --> 01:52:46,479
He built his tent on the great lands!

1328
01:52:47,080 --> 01:52:53,319
What did he do to make
Holofira Hatun happy?

1329
01:52:53,440 --> 01:52:58,759
He broke many hordes under his sword!

1330
01:52:58,840 --> 01:53:02,319
Did he break any hearts?
Did he say anything bad?

1331
01:53:02,440 --> 01:53:05,679
He never broke hearts
or said anything bad.

1332
01:53:05,760 --> 01:53:09,079
He married Holofira Hatun!

1333
01:53:09,120 --> 01:53:14,479
Then, may Allah make them happy!

1334
01:53:14,560 --> 01:53:16,199
Ameen!

1335
01:53:16,240 --> 01:53:22,119
-Then, may Allah make them happy!
-May they live happily!

1336
01:53:57,520 --> 01:53:59,519
My Holofira.

1337
01:54:00,480 --> 01:54:02,359
My first love.

1338
01:54:07,040 --> 01:54:09,319
Hatun.

1339
01:55:05,560 --> 01:55:13,439
You've made my yesterday, today
and tomorrow happy by entering my life

1340
01:55:14,200 --> 01:55:21,239
My creator shall let us have babies and make
our tent a happy place, too.

1341
01:55:21,680 --> 01:55:28,679
I hope that we will be
always happy from now on.

1342
01:55:31,320 --> 01:55:32,719
My Bey.

1343
01:55:33,400 --> 01:55:36,119
"My Bey" huh? My Holofira.

1344
01:55:40,120 --> 01:55:41,719
With you...

1345
01:55:43,160 --> 01:55:45,719
...we have gone through a lot.

1346
01:55:46,160 --> 01:55:48,399
But every separation we experienced...

1347
01:55:48,960 --> 01:55:51,519
...made our love stronger.

1348
01:55:54,000 --> 01:55:56,399
In every path you set foot on...

1349
01:55:57,240 --> 01:55:59,279
...as long as I can...

1350
01:56:00,040 --> 01:56:02,039
..as long as I live..

1351
01:56:02,720 --> 01:56:04,559
..with all my heart..

1352
01:56:04,840 --> 01:56:06,559
...I will be by your side.

1353
01:56:39,000 --> 01:56:41,079
Oh Praise be!

1354
01:56:41,560 --> 01:56:43,719
Oh Praise be!

1355
01:56:44,280 --> 01:56:46,319
My Bey.

1356
01:56:48,000 --> 01:56:49,759
Greek people rebelled, my Bey.

1357
01:56:49,760 --> 01:56:52,759
They are accusing our
shahzade of killing the priest.

1358
01:56:53,240 --> 01:56:54,839
Sogut is on fire.

1359
01:56:55,680 --> 01:56:57,359
What are you saying, Aykurt?

1360
01:56:57,360 --> 01:56:59,319
Our alps are trying to stop them, but...

1361
01:56:59,520 --> 01:57:01,559
...the rebellion is getting worse.

1362
01:57:01,680 --> 01:57:02,839
Sogut is on fire.

1363
01:57:02,840 --> 01:57:03,879
How is that possible?

1364
01:57:03,880 --> 01:57:07,399
If you are not powerful
enough to stop the rebellion...

1365
01:57:07,680 --> 01:57:10,679
...I will help you with all my state!

1366
01:57:10,680 --> 01:57:12,079
No!

1367
01:57:13,720 --> 01:57:15,559
Begum Hatun.

1368
01:57:15,640 --> 01:57:17,519
Go to Karadin.

1369
01:57:18,240 --> 01:57:19,799
Secure the castle.

1370
01:57:19,800 --> 01:57:21,439
As you command my Bey.

1371
01:57:22,000 --> 01:57:23,719
Bayhan Bey, Gencer Bey.

1372
01:57:23,720 --> 01:57:27,279
Take your positions in the borders.

1373
01:57:27,280 --> 01:57:30,119
Keep your eyes open,
and your swords sharp.

1374
01:57:30,280 --> 01:57:31,679
As you command my Bey.

1375
01:57:31,960 --> 01:57:32,599
Alaeddin.

1376
01:57:32,600 --> 01:57:33,519
My Bey.

1377
01:57:33,520 --> 01:57:34,959
Prepare the alps.

1378
01:57:36,640 --> 01:57:38,279
We are going to Sogut.

1379
01:57:38,280 --> 01:57:40,799
As you command my Bey.

1380
01:58:29,560 --> 01:58:31,639
What are you up to Lucas!

1381
01:58:33,080 --> 01:58:37,239
The army is ready for Karadin
siege, Commander Lucas!

1382
01:58:45,640 --> 01:58:49,719
The Turks are blinded by the rebellion.

1383
01:58:50,400 --> 01:58:52,999
And we will open their
eyes with Karadin siege!

1384
01:58:56,640 --> 01:58:59,479
My soldiers! Today...

1385
01:59:00,560 --> 01:59:02,279
...is the day of victory!

1386
01:59:04,320 --> 01:59:07,559
It's the day to save the Karadin Castle...

1387
01:59:07,920 --> 01:59:10,359
...stolen by the Turks!

1388
01:59:11,360 --> 01:59:14,639
Before Turks realize what's going on...

1389
01:59:15,200 --> 01:59:17,839
...we will be inside!

1390
01:59:24,920 --> 01:59:28,279
The victory belongs to Holy Roman Empire!

1391
01:59:28,640 --> 01:59:32,039
The victory belongs to Holy Roman Empire!

1392
01:59:32,480 --> 01:59:37,079
Go and show the power of
Byzantine to the whole world!

1393
01:59:41,880 --> 01:59:42,999
Come on!

1394
01:59:57,840 --> 02:00:00,359
Karadin, huh?

1395
02:00:11,400 --> 02:00:12,519
Sister.

1396
02:00:14,040 --> 02:00:18,439
Just when you were finally
going to be happy, this happened.

1397
02:00:21,520 --> 02:00:22,959
Gonca, let me help you.

1398
02:00:22,960 --> 02:00:23,999
Don't!

1399
02:00:25,120 --> 02:00:27,999
Stay away from me Holofira!

1400
02:00:29,080 --> 02:00:31,519
You brought trouble with yourself!

1401
02:00:37,760 --> 02:00:38,799
Enough Gonca.

1402
02:00:40,160 --> 02:00:40,999
Enough.

1403
02:00:42,280 --> 02:00:44,159
It's not the time.

1404
02:00:44,840 --> 02:00:45,719
Don't do it Gonca Hatun.

1405
02:00:46,600 --> 02:00:48,799
We're already surrounded by fire.

1406
02:00:48,880 --> 02:00:50,679
Holofira's upset too.

1407
02:00:50,720 --> 02:00:52,759
Holofira lit the fire.

1408
02:00:55,640 --> 02:00:57,639
She had my baby die.

1409
02:00:58,200 --> 02:01:01,159
And now the fire is burning Kayi.

1410
02:01:03,880 --> 02:01:05,839
You started the Greek riot, Holofira.

1411
02:01:06,680 --> 02:01:08,679
The fire you started..

1412
02:01:08,920 --> 02:01:10,799
...is burning the people now.

1413
02:01:11,160 --> 02:01:12,359
Aunt...

1414
02:01:12,720 --> 02:01:16,359
...Holofira's upset too, don't you see?

1415
02:01:19,480 --> 02:01:21,519
I see Fatma. I see it all.

1416
02:01:22,240 --> 02:01:24,519
But you're blind.

1417
02:01:26,680 --> 02:01:29,759
I guess you don't see my pain Fatma.

1418
02:01:33,400 --> 02:01:33,999
Maybe...

1419
02:01:36,960 --> 02:01:38,999
...I have no place in this tribe.

1420
02:01:55,160 --> 02:01:57,199
Don't be upset aunt.

1421
02:02:40,120 --> 02:02:42,519
Such hatred. Such anger.

1422
02:02:42,960 --> 02:02:45,159
They burned it all down.

1423
02:02:47,200 --> 02:02:49,559
They'll pay for it Bala Hatun.

1424
02:02:50,000 --> 02:02:51,519
They will.

1425
02:02:51,800 --> 02:02:53,319
How will we fix this?

1426
02:02:54,040 --> 02:02:56,839
They're insane. They're like rabid dogs.

1427
02:02:56,960 --> 02:03:01,079
How will they behave before
they see the strength of the Turks?

1428
02:03:01,640 --> 02:03:04,319
If wolves expressed anger always...

1429
02:03:05,240 --> 02:03:07,279
...they'd be just like dogs.

1430
02:03:11,040 --> 02:03:12,639
Orhan. Alaeddin.

1431
02:03:13,080 --> 02:03:14,839
You'll lead the Alps.

1432
02:03:14,840 --> 02:03:16,599
Increase security everywhere.

1433
02:03:16,600 --> 02:03:18,839
As you wish my Bey.

1434
02:03:19,200 --> 02:03:20,119
Let's go.

1435
02:03:39,600 --> 02:03:42,319
Turks and Greeks can never battle.

1436
02:03:42,520 --> 02:03:46,519
The Greeks that are caught will
be caught with no bloodshed.

1437
02:03:46,760 --> 02:03:49,159
I requested Alps from the tribe.

1438
02:03:49,160 --> 02:03:51,159
We'll secure the borders too.

1439
02:03:52,160 --> 02:03:55,119
Begum Hatun. Lukas is
at the gates with his army.

1440
02:03:57,400 --> 02:03:58,879
Lukas.

1441
02:03:59,560 --> 02:04:00,879
What will we do now sister?

1442
02:04:01,880 --> 02:04:02,559
Come.

1443
02:04:21,680 --> 02:04:23,039
Lukas.

1444
02:04:46,800 --> 02:04:48,799
Bithinia's ruler...

1445
02:04:49,360 --> 02:04:53,559
...the honorable commander
of Byzantines, Lukas...

1446
02:04:54,160 --> 02:04:56,359
...wants you to surrender
and hand over Karadin.

1447
02:04:57,120 --> 02:05:00,199
I guess Lukas' army wants to
taste my army's swords today.

1448
02:05:00,920 --> 02:05:02,119
If he attacks...

1449
02:05:02,920 --> 02:05:05,639
...that devil's army will vanish
before they get to my gates.

1450
02:05:06,040 --> 02:05:08,359
Don't trust yourself so much Begum Hatun.

1451
02:05:08,920 --> 02:05:11,279
Osman Bey or someone else...

1452
02:05:11,520 --> 02:05:13,399
..won't be able to come in time.

1453
02:05:14,120 --> 02:05:18,719
Have mercy on your brother
and your Alps. Surrender.

1454
02:05:19,120 --> 02:05:22,359
Karadin's people aren't afraid of Shahada.

1455
02:05:23,440 --> 02:05:25,759
Lukas can do as he wishes.

1456
02:05:40,240 --> 02:05:42,291
If the support doesn't
make it in time it will...

1457
02:05:42,303 --> 02:05:44,279
...be a challenge to go
against that army but...

1458
02:05:44,320 --> 02:05:45,599
..we'll see.

1459
02:05:55,200 --> 02:05:58,679
My sister in law Gonca likes you a lot.

1460
02:05:58,680 --> 02:06:00,959
You know that right Holofira?

1461
02:06:01,680 --> 02:06:04,719
Gonca and I were like sisters.

1462
02:06:05,600 --> 02:06:08,759
How could she think that I would hurt her?

1463
02:06:09,400 --> 02:06:11,959
Her heart is aflame right now.

1464
02:06:11,960 --> 02:06:14,319
That's why she's doing this.

1465
02:06:14,800 --> 02:06:17,159
Until her fire dies out...

1466
02:06:17,160 --> 02:06:19,439
...we have to be understanding.

1467
02:06:21,440 --> 02:06:23,119
Fatma.

1468
02:06:25,680 --> 02:06:28,319
You've grown up a lot.

1469
02:06:34,880 --> 02:06:36,679
Gonca is missing.

1470
02:06:37,480 --> 02:06:39,799
Gonca is missing.

1471
02:06:41,440 --> 02:06:43,279
What are you saying Ulgen Hatun?

1472
02:06:43,280 --> 02:06:45,719
I've checked everywhere, 
she's not here.

1473
02:06:46,160 --> 02:06:47,319
What?

1474
02:06:47,320 --> 02:06:49,919
She's not here Fatma. I went
to her tent and she wasn't there.

1475
02:06:49,920 --> 02:06:52,559
I've checked everywhere,
where could she be?

1476
02:06:52,960 --> 02:06:54,759
May Allah protect!

1477
02:06:54,760 --> 02:06:57,479
Her pain is so grand that...

1478
02:06:57,480 --> 02:07:00,519
...she even told me that we should leave.

1479
02:07:01,000 --> 02:07:03,399
Sister in law..

1480
02:07:03,400 --> 02:07:06,359
...don't let it be that
you did something crazy.

1481
02:07:07,760 --> 02:07:09,959
Cerkutay, open it.

1482
02:07:21,040 --> 02:07:24,679
This is not something the
innocent Greek people would do.

1483
02:07:24,920 --> 02:07:26,639
It's clear...

1484
02:07:26,640 --> 02:07:29,119
...the devil is among us.

1485
02:07:29,760 --> 02:07:32,719
Bad deeds are done in secret but
they never remain as such my bey.

1486
02:07:32,720 --> 02:07:35,519
We will of course make
those who did this pay.

1487
02:07:35,520 --> 02:07:37,679
We will.

1488
02:07:39,200 --> 02:07:40,879
From Ilbay.

1489
02:07:42,640 --> 02:07:44,599
From Ilbay, my bey.

1490
02:07:51,040 --> 02:07:53,359
What does it say my bey?

1491
02:07:55,520 --> 02:07:57,999
Lucas is attacking Karadin.

1492
02:07:59,600 --> 02:08:02,239
This is a move to make us waste time.

1493
02:08:03,480 --> 02:08:06,677
Cerkutay, tell the
alps to increase the security measures.

1494
02:08:06,677 --> 02:08:09,799
-As you wish my bey.
-We're going to Karadin right away.

1495
02:08:16,160 --> 02:08:17,719
Karadin.

1496
02:08:17,720 --> 02:08:21,439
You are the mark of my victory.

1497
02:08:32,640 --> 02:08:34,719
Soldiers.

1498
02:08:36,200 --> 02:08:39,719
Those who welcome death with bravery...

1499
02:08:39,720 --> 02:08:42,119
...will never be defeated.

1500
02:08:42,520 --> 02:08:46,919
Turks are trying to end our race.

1501
02:08:47,480 --> 02:08:52,519
We will never let that happen.

1502
02:08:56,280 --> 02:09:00,919
For great Byzantine.

1503
02:09:01,160 --> 02:09:02,599
Take war formation.

1504
02:09:02,600 --> 02:09:06,359
Archers on my mark. Everyone
in their place. Come on.

1505
02:09:06,360 --> 02:09:07,919
Come on alps.

1506
02:09:07,920 --> 02:09:11,439
May Allah be with us.

1507
02:09:12,120 --> 02:09:14,879
Attack.

1508
02:09:17,640 --> 02:09:19,319
Stop.

1509
02:09:37,080 --> 02:09:38,919
Attention.

1510
02:09:53,440 --> 02:09:54,879
Where are you...

1511
02:09:55,280 --> 02:09:59,999
...going all fired up like this Lucas?

1512
02:10:00,160 --> 02:10:03,599
What are you doing here Karesi Bey?

1513
02:10:04,600 --> 02:10:10,479
I came to show a commander
who thinks he's very smart...

1514
02:10:10,640 --> 02:10:13,959
...his place.

1515
02:10:17,520 --> 02:10:19,039
You...

1516
02:10:19,400 --> 02:10:22,559
Weren't you on my side Karesi Bey?

1517
02:10:23,120 --> 02:10:25,959
If I was on your side...

1518
02:10:26,200 --> 02:10:28,919
...would I be standing here right now?

1519
02:10:33,280 --> 02:10:37,319
I'm not on your side,
I'm right before you.

1520
02:10:40,960 --> 02:10:45,172
Don't you think I beat
whoever tries to attack

1521
02:10:45,184 --> 02:10:48,959
Turk's lands even if
they belong to Osman?

1522
02:10:55,240 --> 02:10:59,519
Karasi Bey, I'm here with my whole army.

1523
02:10:59,600 --> 02:11:02,279
I'm here to capture Karadin.

1524
02:11:02,440 --> 02:11:06,039
You cannot stop me.

1525
02:11:06,760 --> 02:11:14,119
If your whole army is here, who
will keep Brusa away from my wrath?

1526
02:11:18,960 --> 02:11:21,279
You are making a mistake, Karasi Bey.

1527
02:11:21,320 --> 02:11:23,879
This will lead you to your end.

1528
02:11:23,920 --> 02:11:26,839
I always follow the
things I believe are right.

1529
02:11:27,000 --> 02:11:33,479
My army is at Brusa, both on the
sea and land. They are ready in Nikea.

1530
02:11:33,680 --> 02:11:36,639
They are waiting for my order.

1531
02:11:36,920 --> 02:11:42,959
If a castle falls here, a
city will be destroyed there.

1532
02:11:49,360 --> 02:11:52,759
So, you are taking the
risk of being my enemy.

1533
02:11:52,840 --> 02:11:57,799
Its consequences will be dire, Karasi Bey.

1534
02:11:58,080 --> 02:12:02,319
Here is the battleground,
here is the warrior!

1535
02:12:03,440 --> 02:12:06,959
I never refrain from war.

1536
02:12:07,080 --> 02:12:10,279
You either retreat from Karadin..

1537
02:12:10,440 --> 02:12:16,519
...or I'll let no one be alive in Brusa!

1538
02:12:17,880 --> 02:12:22,759
Do you want Osman's victory?
What do you want? Why?

1539
02:12:23,320 --> 02:12:26,239
You don't understand, Lukas.

1540
02:12:26,600 --> 02:12:31,439
Osman has gotten greater loss now.

1541
02:12:43,560 --> 02:12:45,959
I'm Osman Bey.

1542
02:12:46,240 --> 02:12:49,279
I've walked a great
distance. I've run a lot.

1543
02:12:49,360 --> 02:12:54,519
I've found many comrades beside
me and many enemies against me

1544
02:12:54,760 --> 02:12:57,319
I didn't give up, I didn't give in.

1545
02:12:57,480 --> 02:13:01,919
I've matured in the road of
The Truth with the sunnah of the Prophet.

1546
02:13:02,040 --> 02:13:06,390
I was ready to sacrifice
my life and my comrades' life...

1547
02:13:06,402 --> 02:13:10,679
...in order to make
sure the Turks live forever.

1548
02:13:11,040 --> 02:13:15,719
While we were a small tribe, I've
scaled up my ideals and became a state.

1549
02:13:16,520 --> 02:13:19,359
Now I am saying this to the whole world!

1550
02:13:19,920 --> 02:13:23,119
Either victory or death!